msgid ""
"Your user instances could not be loaded as your Sentinel Hub account was "
"not set up/expired. You can still use Copernicus Browser but you will not "
"be able to use personal user instances. To be able to set up personal user "
"instances you can apply for a 30-days free trial or consider subscribing to "
"one of the plans: "
msgstr ""
"Dine brugerinstanser kunne ikke indlæses, da din Sentinel Hub-konto ikke "
"var oprettet eller er udløbet. Du kan stadig bruge Copernicus Browser, men "
"du vil ikke kunne bruge personlige brugerinstanser. For at kunne oprette "
"personlige brugerinstanser kan du ansøge om en gratis 30-dages prøveperiode "
"eller overveje at abonnere på en af planerne: "

