#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"An evalscript (or \"custom script\") is a piece of Javascript code that "
"defines how the satellite data\n"
"should be processed by Sentinel Hub (one of the underlying services that "
"powers the Browser) and what values the\n"
"service should return.\n"
"Read more about custom scripts in our [tutorials](${ tutorial }) or use "
"already prepared scripts\n"
"for different collections from the [custom script repository](${ repo })."
msgstr ""
"Et evalscript (eller “brugerdefineret script”) er et stykke "
"Javascript-kode, der definerer, hvordan satellitdataene\n"
"skal behandles af Sentinel Hub (en af de underliggende tjenester, der "
"driver Browseren), og hvilke værdier\n"
"tjenesten skal returnere.\n"
"Læs mere om brugerdefinerede scripts i vores [vejledninger](${ tutorial }), "
"eller brug allerede forberedte scripts\n"
"til forskellige kollektioner fra [arkivet med brugerdefinerede scripts](${ "
"repo })."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"An OpenEO process graph is a chain of processes that defines how satellite "
"data should be processed by the synchronous OpenEO API (one of the "
"underlying services that powers the Browser) and what values the service "
"should return. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Read more about processes and process graphs [here](${ processGraphUrl })."
msgstr ""
"En OpenEO-procesgraf er en kæde af processer, der definerer, hvordan "
"satellitdata skal behandles af den synkrone OpenEO API (en af de "
"underliggende tjenester, der driver Browseren), og hvilke værdier tjenesten "
"skal returnere. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Læs mere om processer og procesgrafer [her](${ processGraphUrl })."

msgid ""
"Note: The **collection_id**, **spatial_extent**, **temporal_extent**, and "
"**advanced options** settings (e.g., mosaickingOrder, upsampling, "
"downsampling) are read-only. These values are updated automatically based "
"on your map navigation, date selection, collection choice, and advanced "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Bemærk: Indstillingerne **collection_id**, **spatial_extent**, "
"**temporal_extent** og **avancerede indstillinger** (f.eks. "
"mosaickingOrder, upsampling, downsampling) er skrivebeskyttede. Disse "
"værdier opdateres automatisk ud fra din kortnavigation, datovalg, valg af "
"kollektion og avancerede indstillinger."

