msgid ""
"The mosaicking order controls which data is used where imagery overlaps on "
"the map. Fills overlapping areas with either the newest (most recent) or "
"oldest (least recent) acquisition."
msgstr ""
"Mosaikrækkefølgen styrer, hvilke data der bruges, hvor billeder overlapper "
"på kortet. Udfylder overlappende områder med enten den nyeste (seneste) "
"eller ældste (mindst nylige) optagelse."

