msgstr "Ugyldigt geodætisk system registreret"

msgid ""
"Could not parse the geometry. Paste a GeoJSON geometry, a bounding box "
"array [minX, minY, maxX, maxY], WKT, or a GEOREF/MGRS reference."
msgstr ""
"Geometrien kunne ikke fortolkes. Indsæt en GeoJSON-geometri, et "
"afgrænsningsramme-array [minX, minY, maxX, maxY], WKT eller en "
"GEOREF/MGRS-reference."

msgid ""
"The input is not valid GeoJSON. Paste a GeoJSON geometry, or a bounding box "
"array [minX, minY, maxX, maxY]."
msgstr ""
"Inputtet er ikke gyldig GeoJSON. Indsæt en GeoJSON-geometri eller et "
"afgrænsningsramme-array [minX, minY, maxX, maxY]."

msgid ""
"The uploaded geometry is invalid (e.g. an unclosed ring, too few points, or "
"duplicate/degenerate vertices). Please fix it and try again."
msgstr ""
"Den uploadede geometri er ugyldig (f.eks. en uafsluttet ring, for få "
"punkter eller duplikerede/degenererede knudepunkter). Ret den, og prøv igen."

msgid ""
"The uploaded polygon is not closed: its first and last points differ. Close "
"the ring and try again."
msgstr ""
"Den uploadede polygon er ikke lukket: dens første og sidste punkt er "
"forskellige. Luk ringen, og prøv igen."

msgid ""
"The uploaded polygon has too few points to form an area. A ring needs at "
"least 3 distinct points. Please fix it and try again."
msgstr ""
"Den uploadede polygon har for få punkter til at danne et areal. En ring "
"kræver mindst 3 forskellige punkter. Ret den, og prøv igen."

msgid ""
"The uploaded polygon contains a repeated point (duplicate consecutive "
"vertices). Remove the duplicate point(s) and try again."
