msgid ""
"The product availability indicates whether a product can be downloaded "
"immediately (*Immediate*) or must first be processed in the user's "
"workspace (*To order*). The workspace offers processing options for:\n"
"- Sentinel-1 Level-1 SLC and\n"
"- Sentinel-2 L2A.\n"
"\n"
"The *To order* filter should therefore only be used when searching for one "
"of these two product types."
msgstr ""
"Produkttilgængeligheden angiver, om et produkt kan downloades med det samme "
"(*Immediate*) eller først skal behandles i brugerens arbejdsområde (*To "
"order*). Arbejdsområdet tilbyder behandlingsmuligheder for:\n"
"- Sentinel-1 Level-1 SLC og\n"
"- Sentinel-2 L2A.\n"
"\n"
"Filteret *To order* bør derfor kun bruges, når der søges efter en af disse "
"to produkttyper."

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-1 data includes products from the Sentinel-1 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-1A (operational since 2014), "
"Sentinel-1B (operational from 2016 to 2022), Sentinel-1C (operational since "
"2025), Sentinel-1D (operational since 2026)."
msgstr ""
"De tilgængelige Sentinel-1-data omfatter produkter fra "
"Sentinel-1-satellitkonstellationen, herunder Sentinel-1A (i drift siden "
"2014), Sentinel-1B (i drift fra 2016 til 2022), Sentinel-1C (i drift siden "
"2025), Sentinel-1D (i drift siden 2026)."

msgid ""
"Determines whether the data was recorded during a descending orbit (flight "
"direction: north - south) or an ascending orbit (flight direction: south - "
"north)."
msgstr ""
"Bestemmer, om dataene blev optaget under et nedadgående kredsløb "
"(flyveretning: nord - syd) eller et opadgående kredsløb (flyveretning: syd "
"- nord)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between successive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 to "
"the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending node "
"crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-1 is in a "
"near-polar, sun-synchronous orbit with a repeat cycle of 12 days and 175 "
"orbits per cycle for a single satellite."
msgstr ""
"Relativt kredsløbsnummer er antallet af hele kredsløb (mellem på hinanden "
"følgende opadgående knudepassager gennem ækvator) siden relativt kredsløb 1 "
"til slutningen af en cyklus. Relativt kredsløb 1 er det kredsløb, hvis "
"opadgående knudepassage er tættest på Greenwich-meridianen. Sentinel-1 "
"befinder sig i et næsten polært, solsynkront kredsløb med en "
"gentagelsescyklus på 12 dage og 175 kredsløb pr. cyklus for en enkelt "
"satellit."

msgid ""
"Sentinel-1 operates in 4 exclusive instrument acquisition modes. Depending "
"on the instrument mode, the data products may be available in different "
"polarisation, resolution and swath withs (between 20 km and 410 km). The "
"four different modes are:\n"
"- Stripmap (SM) \n"
"- Interferometric Wide swath (IW)\n"
"- Extra-Wide swath (EW)\n"
"- Wave (WV)"
msgstr ""
"Sentinel-1 fungerer i 4 eksklusive instrumentoptagelsestilstande. Afhængigt "
"af instrumenttilstanden kan dataprodukterne være tilgængelige i forskellige "
"polariseringer, opløsninger og swath-bredder (mellem 20 km og 410 km). De "
"fire forskellige tilstande er:\n"
"- Stripmap (SM) \n"
"- Interferometric Wide swath (IW)\n"
"- Extra-Wide swath (EW)\n"
"- Wave (WV)"

msgid ""
"Depending on the acquistion mode, the following swaths and identifiers are "
"possible:\n"
"- S1-S6 for SM mode (currently the only supported option)\n"
"- IW1-IW3 for IW mode\n"
"- EW1-EW5 for EW mode\n"
"- WV1-WV2 for WV mode"
msgstr ""
"Afhængigt af optagelsestilstanden er følgende swaths og identifikatorer "
"mulige:\n"
"- S1-S6 for SM-tilstand (pt. den eneste understøttede mulighed)\n"
"- IW1-IW3 for IW-tilstand\n"
"- EW1-EW5 for EW-tilstand\n"
"- WV1-WV2 for WV-tilstand"

msgid ""
"Determines with which polarisation the data was acquired. The first letter "
"indicates the polarisation when sending the signal, the second letter when "
"receiving the signal, e.g., HV = horizontal polarisation when sending the "
"signal and vertical polarisation when receiving.\n"
"\n"
"Data can be acquired in single polarisation HH (SH) or VV (SV) or in dual "
"polarisation HH&HV (DH) or VV&VH (DV), depending on the instrument mode.\n"
"\n"
"SM, IW and EW can be acquired in single or dual polarisation. WV can only "
"be acquired in single polarisation."
msgstr ""
"Bestemmer, med hvilken polarisering dataene blev optaget. Det første "
"bogstav angiver polariseringen ved afsendelse af signalet, det andet "
"bogstav ved modtagelse af signalet, f.eks. HV = horisontal polarisering ved "
"afsendelse af signalet og vertikal polarisering ved modtagelse.\n"
"\n"
"Data kan optages i enkelt polarisering HH (SH) eller VV (SV) eller i "
"dobbelt polarisering HH&HV (DH) eller VV&VH (DV), afhængigt af "
"instrumenttilstanden.\n"
"\n"
"SM, IW og EW kan optages i enkelt eller dobbelt polarisering. WV kan kun "
"optages i enkelt polarisering."

msgid ""
"Only applies for Level-1 GRD products and varies depending on the "
"acquisition mode:\n"
"- 3.5 m pixel spacing (full resolution: only SM mode) \n"
"- 10 m pixel spacing (high resolution: SW, IW mode)\n"
"- 25 m pixel spacing (high resolution: EW mode; medium resolution: WV mode)\n"
"- 40 m pixel spacing (medium resolution: SM, IW, EW mode)"
msgstr ""
"Gælder kun for Level-1 GRD-produkter og varierer afhængigt af "
"optagelsestilstanden:\n"
"- 3,5 m pixelafstand (fuld opløsning: kun SM-tilstand) \n"
"- 10 m pixelafstand (høj opløsning: SW-, IW-tilstand)\n"
"- 25 m pixelafstand (høj opløsning: EW-tilstand; mellemhøj opløsning: "
"WV-tilstand)\n"
"- 40 m pixelafstand (mellemhøj opløsning: SM-, IW-, EW-tilstand)"

msgid ""
"Depending on the processing level different product classes are available:\n"
"- Standard (S): all processing levels\n"
"- Calibration (C): Level-0 products \n"
"- Noise (N): Level-0 products\n"
"- Annotation (A): Level-1 and Level-2 products"
msgstr ""
"Afhængigt af behandlingsniveauet er forskellige produktklasser "
"tilgængelige:\n"
"- Standard (S): alle behandlingsniveauer\n"
"- Kalibrering (C): Level-0-produkter \n"
"- Støj (N): Level-0-produkter\n"
"- Annotering (A): Level-1- og Level-2-produkter"

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-2 data includes products from the Sentinel-2 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-2A (operational since 2015) and "
"Sentinel-2B (operational since  2017)."
msgstr ""
"De tilgængelige Sentinel-2-data omfatter produkter fra "
"Sentinel-2-satellitkonstellationen, herunder Sentinel-2A (i drift siden "
"2015) og Sentinel-2B (i drift siden 2017)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between sucessive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 "
"until the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending "
"node crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-2 is in a "
"sun-synchronous orbit with a 10-day repeat cycle (5-days with both "
"satellites) and 143 orbits per cycle."
msgstr ""
"Relativt kredsløbsnummer er antallet af hele kredsløb (mellem på hinanden "
"følgende opadgående knudepassager gennem ækvator) siden relativt kredsløb 1 "
"indtil slutningen af en cyklus. Relativt kredsløb 1 er det kredsløb, hvis "
"opadgående knudepassage er tættest på Greenwich-meridianen. Sentinel-2 "
"befinder sig i et solsynkront kredsløb med en gentagelsescyklus på 10 dage "
"(5 dage med begge satellitter) og 143 kredsløb pr. cyklus."

msgid "The available Sentinel-2 data is processed either by ESA or by CloudFerro."
msgstr "De tilgængelige Sentinel-2-data behandles enten af ESA eller af CloudFerro."

msgid ""
"Sentinel-3 data is  available in the following timeliness:\n"
"- Near Real Time (NRT):  typically available within 3 hours after data "
"acquisition\n"
"- Short Time Critical (STC): typically available within 48 hours after data "
"acquisition\n"
"- Non Time Critical (NTC): typically available within 1 months after data "
"acquisition"
msgstr ""
"Sentinel-3-data er tilgængelige med følgende rettidighed:\n"
"- Near Real Time (NRT): typisk tilgængelig inden for 3 timer efter "
"dataindsamling\n"
"- Short Time Critical (STC): typisk tilgængelig inden for 48 timer efter "
"dataindsamling\n"
"- Non Time Critical (NTC): typisk tilgængelig inden for 1 måned efter "
"dataindsamling"

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-3 data includes products from the Sentinel-3 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-3A (operational since 2016) and "
"Sentinel-3B (operational since 2018)."
msgstr ""
"De tilgængelige Sentinel-3-data omfatter produkter fra "
"Sentinel-3-satellitkonstellationen, herunder Sentinel-3A (i drift siden "
"2016) og Sentinel-3B (i drift siden 2018)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between successive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 "
"until the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending "
"node crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-3 is in a "
"near-polar, sun-synchronous orbit with a repeat cycle of 27 days."
msgstr ""
"Det relative kredsløbsnummer er antallet af fulde kredsløb (mellem "
"successive passager af den opadgående knude gennem ækvator) fra det "
"relative kredsløb 1 til slutningen af en cyklus. Det relative kredsløb 1 er "
"det kredsløb, hvis passage af den opadgående knude er tættest på "
"Greenwich-meridianen. Sentinel-3 befinder sig i et næsten polært, "
"solsynkront kredsløb med en gentagelsescyklus på 27 dage."

msgid ""
"The timeliness provides information about the delivery time of the data "
"product. For Sentinel-5P there are 3 different timeliness available:\n"
"- Near Real-Time (NRT): available within 3 hours of acquisition\n"
"- Offline: depending on the product, within 12 hours for Level 1B products\n"
"- Reprocessing: no time constraints (performed when major product upgrades "
"are required"
msgstr ""
"Rettidigheden angiver leveringstiden for dataproduktet. For Sentinel-5P "
"findes der 3 forskellige former for rettidighed:\n"
"- Near Real-Time (NRT): tilgængelig inden for 3 timer efter dataindsamling\n"
"- Offline: afhængigt af produktet, inden for 12 timer for Level "
"1B-produkter\n"
"- Reprocessing: ingen tidsbegrænsninger (udføres, når der kræves større "
"produktopgraderinger"

msgid ""
"The absolute Orbit Number is the number of orbits that have elapsed since "
"the first ascending node crossing after launch."
msgstr ""
"Det absolutte kredsløbsnummer er antallet af kredsløb, der er gået siden "
"den første passage af den opadgående knude efter opsendelsen."

msgid ""
"These are pre-operational product types generated by the S5P Product "
"Algorithm Laboratory service."
msgstr ""
"Dette er præoperationelle produkttyper genereret af tjenesten S5P Product "
"Algorithm Laboratory."

