msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. The format in which the data is stored "
"(NetCDF or Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF)."
msgstr ""
"Gælder for alle underkategorier. Det format, som dataene er gemt i (NetCDF "
"eller Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF)."

msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. The unique identifier for the specific "
"dataset within this collection."
msgstr ""
"Gælder for alle underkategorier. Den unikke identifikator for det "
"specifikke datasæt i denne kollektion."

msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. The type of product, identifying the "
"thematic category or processing pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Gælder for alle underkategorier. Produkttypen, som angiver den tematiske "
"kategori eller behandlingskæden."

msgid ""
"Only applies to data sources within the Snow, Water Bodies and Auxiliary "
"Data categories."
msgstr ""
"Gælder kun for datakilder inden for kategorierne Sne, Vandområder og "
"Hjælpedata."

msgid ""
"Only applies to data sources within Urban Atlas. Filters results by the "
"country the data covers. Country codes follow the Eurostat convention, see "
"the full list "
"[here](https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index."
"php?title=Glossary%3ACountry_codes)."
msgstr ""
"Gælder kun for datakilder inden for Urban Atlas. Filtrerer resultater efter "
"det land, som dataene dækker. Landekoder følger Eurostats konvention, se "
"den fulde liste "
"[her](https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index."
"php?title=Glossary%3ACountry_codes)."

msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. Missions whose input data was used to "
"process the product."
msgstr ""
"Gælder for alle underkategorier. Missioner, hvis inputdata blev brugt til "
"at behandle produktet."

msgid ""
"Near real-time consolidation level (RT0–RT6). RT0 is the fastest delivery; "
"RT6 has the highest accuracy. Only applies to data sources within the "
"Vegetation category."
msgstr ""
"Konsolideringsniveau for næsten realtid (RT0–RT6). RT0 er den hurtigste "
"levering; RT6 har den højeste nøjagtighed. Gælder kun for datakilder inden "
"for kategorien Vegetation."

msgid ""
"Only applies to data sources within Protected Areas. Filters results by "
"DUid (regional delivery unit code)."
msgstr ""
"Gælder kun for datakilder inden for Beskyttede områder. Filtrerer "
"resultater efter DUid (kode for regional leveringsenhed)."

