msgid ""
"**Sentinel-5P** is a satellite that provides atmospheric measurements to be "
"used for air quality, ozone monitoring, UV radiation,\n"
"and climate monitoring and forecasting.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 7 x 3.5km (that is, only details bigger than 7 x "
"3.5km can be seen).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 1 day to revisit the same area.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since April 2018 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Monitoring the concentration of carbon monoxide (CO), "
"nitrogen dioxide (NO2) and ozone (O3) in the air. Monitoring the UV aerosol "
"index (AER_AI) and various geophysical parameters of clouds (Cloud)."
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-5P** er en satellit, der leverer atmosfæriske målinger til brug "
"for luftkvalitet, overvågning af ozon, UV-stråling\n"
"samt overvågning og prognoser for klimaet.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** 7 x 3,5 km (det vil sige, at kun detaljer, der er "
"større end 7 x 3,5 km, kan ses).\n"
"\n"
"**Gentagelsestid:** Højst 1 dag til at besøge det samme område igen.\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** Fra april 2018 og frem.\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse:** Overvågning af koncentrationen af kulilte (CO), "
"nitrogendioxid (NO2) og ozon (O3) i luften. Overvågning af "
"UV-aerosolindekset (AER_AI) og forskellige geofysiske parametre for skyer "
"(Cloud)."

msgid ""
"### Ozone (O3)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ozone is of crucial importance for the equilibrium of the Earth atmosphere. "
"In the stratosphere, the ozone layer shields the biosphere from dangerous "
"solar ultraviolet radiation. In the troposphere, it acts as an efficient "
"cleansing agent, but at high concentration it also becomes harmful to the "
"health of humans, animals, and vegetation. Ozone is also an important "
"greenhouse-gas contributor to ongoing climate change. Since the discovery "
"of the Antarctic ozone hole in the 1980s and the subsequent Montreal "
"Protocol regulating the production of chlorine-containing ozone-depleting "
"substances, ozone has been routinely monitored from the ground and from "
"space. Measurements are in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ozone-profile)"
msgstr ""
"### Ozon (O3)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ozon er af afgørende betydning for ligevægten i Jordens atmosfære. I "
"stratosfæren beskytter ozonlaget biosfæren mod farlig ultraviolet stråling "
"fra Solen. I troposfæren fungerer det som et effektivt rensemiddel, men i "
"høje koncentrationer bliver det også skadeligt for mennesker, dyr og "
"vegetation. Ozon er også en vigtig drivhusgas, der bidrager til de "
"igangværende klimaændringer. Siden opdagelsen af ozonhullet over Antarktis "
"i 1980'erne og den efterfølgende Montreal-protokol, der regulerer "
"produktionen af klorholdige ozonnedbrydende stoffer, er ozon blevet "
"overvåget rutinemæssigt fra jorden og fra rummet. Målingerne er i mol pr. "
"kvadratmeter (mol/ m^2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ozone-profile)"

msgid ""
"### Nitrogen Dioxide (NO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Nitrogen dioxide (NO2) and nitrogen oxide (NO) together are usually "
"referred to as nitrogen oxides. They are important trace gases in the "
"Earth’s atmosphere, present in both the troposphere and the stratosphere. "
"They enter the atmosphere as a result of anthropogenic activities "
"(particularly fossil fuel combustion and biomass burning) and natural "
"processes (such as microbiological processes in soils, wildfires and "
"lightning). Measurements are in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-nitrogen-"
"dioxide)"
msgstr ""
"### Nitrogendioxid (NO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Nitrogendioxid (NO2) og nitrogenoxid (NO) omtales sammen normalt som "
"nitrogenoxider. De er vigtige sporgasser i Jordens atmosfære og findes både "
"i troposfæren og i stratosfæren. De kommer ud i atmosfæren som følge af "
"menneskeskabte aktiviteter (især forbrænding af fossile brændstoffer og "
"afbrænding af biomasse) og naturlige processer (såsom mikrobiologiske "
"processer i jord, naturbrande og lyn). Målingerne er i mol pr. kvadratmeter "
"(mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-nitrogen-"
"dioxide)"

msgid ""
"### Sulfur Dioxide (SO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Sulphur dioxide enters the Earth’s atmosphere through both natural and "
"anthropogenic (human made) processes. It plays a role in chemistry on a "
"local and global scale and its impact ranges from short term pollution to "
"effects on climate. Only about 30% of the emitted SO2 comes from natural "
"sources; the majority is of anthropogenic origin. Sentinel-5P/TROPOMI "
"instrument samples the Earth’s surface with a revisit time of one day with "
"a spatial resolution of 3.5 x 7 km which allows the resolution of fine "
"details including the detection of smaller SO2 plumes. Measurements are in "
"mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-sulphur-dioxide)"
msgstr ""
"### Svovldioxid (SO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Svovldioxid kommer ud i Jordens atmosfære gennem både naturlige og "
"menneskeskabte processer. Det spiller en rolle i kemien på lokal og global "
"skala, og dets påvirkning spænder fra kortvarig forurening til effekter på "
"klimaet. Kun omkring 30 % af den udledte SO2 stammer fra naturlige kilder; "
"størstedelen er af menneskeskabt oprindelse. Instrumentet "
"Sentinel-5P/TROPOMI måler Jordens overflade med en gentagelsestid på én dag "
"og en rumlig opløsning på 3,5 x 7 km, hvilket gør det muligt at skelne fine "
"detaljer, herunder opdagelse af mindre SO2-fanér. Målingerne er i mol pr. "
"kvadratmeter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-sulphur-dioxide)"

msgid ""
"### Carbon Monoxide (CO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Carbon monoxide (CO) is an important atmospheric trace gas. In certain "
"urban areas, it is a major atmospheric pollutant. Main sources of CO are "
"combustion of fossil fuels, biomass burning, and atmospheric oxidation of "
"methane and other hydrocarbons. The carbon monoxide total column is "
"measured in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-carbon-monoxide)"
msgstr ""
"### Kulilte (CO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Kulilte (CO) er en vigtig atmosfærisk sporgas. I visse byområder er det en "
"væsentlig luftforurening. Hovedkilderne til CO er forbrænding af fossile "
"brændstoffer, afbrænding af biomasse og atmosfærisk oxidation af metan og "
"andre kulbrinter. Den samlede søjle af kulilte måles i mol pr. kvadratmeter "
"(mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-carbon-monoxide)"

msgid ""
"### Formaldehyde (HCHO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Long term satellite observations of tropospheric formaldehyde (HCHO) are "
"essential to support air quality and chemistry-climate related studies from "
"the regional to the global scale. The seasonal and inter-annual variations "
"of the formaldehyde distribution are principally related to temperature "
"changes and fire events, but also to changes in anthropogenic (human-made) "
"activities. Its lifetime being of the order of a few hours, HCHO "
"concentrations in the boundary layer can be directly related to the release "
"of short-lived hydrocarbons, which mostly cannot be observed directly from "
"space. Measurements are in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-formaldehyde)"
msgstr ""
"### Formaldehyd (HCHO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Langsigtede satellitobservationer af troposfærisk formaldehyd (HCHO) er "
"afgørende for at understøtte undersøgelser af luftkvalitet og "
"kemi-klima-sammenhænge fra regional til global skala. De sæsonbestemte og "
"årlige variationer i formaldehydfordelingen hænger primært sammen med "
"temperaturændringer og brandhændelser, men også med ændringer i "
"menneskeskabte aktiviteter. Da dets levetid er i størrelsesordenen nogle få "
"timer, kan HCHO-koncentrationer i grænselaget sættes direkte i forbindelse "
"med udledningen af kortlivede kulbrinter, som for det meste ikke kan "
"observeres direkte fra rummet. Målingerne er i mol pr. kvadratmeter (mol/ "
"m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-formaldehyde)"

msgid ""
"### Methane (CH4)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Methane is, after carbon dioxide, the most important contributor to the "
"anthropogenically (caused by human activity) enhanced greenhouse effect. "
"Measurements are provided in parts per billion (ppb) with a spatial "
"resolution of 7 km x 3.5 km.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/tropomi-level-2-methane)"
msgstr ""
"### Metan (CH4)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Metan er efter kuldioxid den vigtigste bidragyder til den menneskeskabt "
"(forårsaget af menneskelig aktivitet) forstærkede drivhuseffekt. Målingerne "
"leveres i parts per billion (ppb) med en rumlig opløsning på 7 km x 3,5 km.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/tropomi-level-2-methane)"

msgid ""
"### Aerosol Index\n"
"\n"
"The Aerosol Index (AI) is a qualitative index indicating the presence of "
"elevated layers of aerosols in the atmosphere. It can be used to detect the "
"presence of UV absorbing aerosols such as desert dust and volcanic ash "
"plumes. Positive values (from light blue to red) indicate the presence of "
"UV-absorbing aerosol. This index is calculated for two pairs of "
"wavelengths: 340/380 nm and 354/388 nm.\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ultraviolet-"
"aerosol-index)"
msgstr ""
"### Aerosolindeks\n"
"\n"
"Aerosolindekset (AI) er et kvalitativt indeks, der angiver tilstedeværelsen "
"af forhøjede aerosollag i atmosfæren. Det kan bruges til at opdage "
"tilstedeværelsen af UV-absorberende aerosoler som ørkenstøv og vulkanske "
"askefaner. Positive værdier (fra lyseblå til rød) angiver tilstedeværelsen "
"af UV-absorberende aerosol. Dette indeks beregnes for to par bølgelængder: "
"340/380 nm og 354/388 nm.\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ultraviolet-"
"aerosol-index)"

msgid ""
"### Cloud\n"
"\n"
"The TROPOMI instrument, single payload onboard Sentinel-5 Precursor, "
"retrieves operationally the most important quantities for cloud correction "
"of satellite trace gas retrievals: cloud fraction, cloud optical thickness "
"(albedo), and cloud-top pressure (height). Cloud parameters from TROPOMI "
"are not only used for enhancing the accuracy of trace gas retrievals, but "
"also to extend the satellite data record of cloud information.\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-cloud)."
msgstr ""
"### Skyer\n"
"\n"
"TROPOMI-instrumentet, den eneste nyttelast om bord på Sentinel-5 Precursor, "
"udleder operationelt de vigtigste størrelser til skykorrektion af "
"satellitters udledning af sporgasser: skydækningsgrad, skyens optiske "
"tykkelse (albedo) og skytoptryk (højde). Skyparametre fra TROPOMI bruges "
"ikke blot til at forbedre nøjagtigheden af udledning af sporgasser, men "
"også til at udvide satellitternes dataserie med oplysninger om skyer.\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-cloud)."

msgid ""
"**Sentinel-3** mission's main objective is to measure the sea surface "
"topography, the sea and land surface temperature, and the colour of the "
"ocean and land surface. To achieve this goal, Sentinel-3 has a combination "
"of different instruments on board. The most important instruments are the "
"Ocean and Land Colour Instrument (OLCI), the SAR Radar Altimeter (SRAL) and "
"the Sea and Land Surface Temperature Radiometer (SLSTR).\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2016 onwards."
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-3**-missionens hovedformål er at måle havoverfladens topografi, "
"havets og landoverfladens temperatur samt havets og landoverfladens farve. "
"For at nå dette mål har Sentinel-3 en kombination af forskellige "
"instrumenter om bord. De vigtigste instrumenter er Ocean and Land Colour "
"Instrument (OLCI), SAR Radar Altimeter (SRAL) og Sea and Land Surface "
"Temperature Radiometer (SLSTR).\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** Fra maj 2016 og frem."

msgid ""
"The **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** instrument on board "
"Sentinel-3 measures the global and regional sea and land surface \n"
"temperature. The SLSTR covers the visible, shortwave infrared, and thermal "
"infrared wavelengths of the electromagnetic spectrum. \n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 500m for visible, near- and shortwave infrared "
"wavelengths and 1km for thermal infrared (that is, only details \n"
"bigger than 500m and 1km can be seen, respectively).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 1 day to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2016 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Climate change monitoring, vegetation monitoring, active "
"fire detection, land and sea surface temperature monitoring."
msgstr ""
"Instrumentet **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** om bord på "
"Sentinel-3 måler den globale og regionale temperatur på hav- og "
"landoverflader. \n"
"SLSTR dækker de synlige, kortbølgede infrarøde og termiske infrarøde "
"bølgelængder i det elektromagnetiske spektrum. \n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** 500 m for synlige, nære og kortbølgede infrarøde "
"bølgelængder og 1 km for termisk infrarød (det vil sige, at kun detaljer \n"
"større end henholdsvis 500 m og 1 km kan ses).\n"
"\n"
"**Gentagelsestid:** Højst 1 dag til at besøge det samme område igen ved "
"brug af begge satellitter.\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** Fra maj 2016 og frem.\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse:** Overvågning af klimaændringer, overvågning af "
"vegetation, detektion af aktive brande, overvågning af temperaturen på "
"land- og havoverflader."

msgid ""
"The **Ocean and Land Colour Instrument (OLCI)** on board Sentinel-3 is a "
"spectrometer that \n"
"measures the solar radiation reflected by Earth, and it monitors the ocean, "
"the environment, \n"
"and climate. It provides more frequent visible imagery than Sentinel-2 but "
"at a lower resolution\n"
"and with more wavelengths covered. The Sentinel-3 OLCI instrument continues "
"the measurements previously performed by the MERIS instrument on board "
"Envisat, whose mission concluded.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 300m (that is, only details bigger than 300m can be "
"seen).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 2 days to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2016 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Surface topography, ocean and land surface colour "
"observations and monitoring."
msgstr ""
"**Ocean and Land Colour Instrument (OLCI)** om bord på Sentinel-3 er et "
"spektrometer, der \n"
"måler den solstråling, som Jorden reflekterer, og det overvåger havet, "
"miljøet \n"
"og klimaet. Det leverer hyppigere synlige billeder end Sentinel-2, men med "
"lavere opløsning\n"
"og flere dækkede bølgelængder. Sentinel-3 OLCI-instrumentet viderefører de "
"målinger, som tidligere blev udført af MERIS-instrumentet om bord på "
"Envisat, hvis mission er afsluttet.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** 300 m (det vil sige, at kun detaljer, der er større "
"end 300 m, kan ses).\n"
"\n"
"**Gentagelsestid:** Højst 2 dage til at besøge det samme område igen ved "
"brug af begge satellitter.\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** Fra maj 2016 og frem.\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse:** Overfladetopografi, observation og overvågning "
"af havets og landoverfladens farve."

msgid ""
"**The Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** is a combination of the OLCI and SLSTR "
"acquisitions with original objective to provide surface vegetation "
"products. [The Level-2 "
"SYN](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products) product provides "
"surface reflectances for all SYN channels and aerosol parameters over land.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution**: 300 m  \n"
"\n"
"**Temporal resolution**: < 2 days  \n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: Global since October 2018  \n"
"\n"
"**Common usage**: Land Monitoring and Security, Climate Change Monitoring"
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** er en kombination af OLCI- og SLSTR-optagelser med "
"det oprindelige formål at levere produkter om overfladevegetation. [Level-2 "
"SYN](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products)-produktet "
"leverer overfladereflektanser for alle SYN-kanaler og aerosolparametre over "
"land.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning**: 300 m  \n"
"\n"
"**Tidsmæssig opløsning**: < 2 dage  \n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed**: Globalt fra oktober 2018  \n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse**: Overvågning af land og sikkerhed, overvågning af "
"klimaændringer"

msgid ""
"**The Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** is a combination of the OLCI and SLSTR "
"acquisitions with original objective to provide surface vegetation "
"products. [The Level-2 "
"VG1](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products) product "
"contains 1 km VEGETATION-like product, 1 day synthesis surface reflectances "
"and NDVI.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Temporal resolution**: Daily\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: Global since October 2018\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage**: Land Monitoring and Security, Climate Change Monitoring"
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** er en kombination af OLCI- og SLSTR-optagelser med "
"det oprindelige formål at levere produkter om overfladevegetation. [Level-2 "
"VG1](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products)-produktet "
"indeholder et VEGETATION-lignende produkt på 1 km, overfladereflektanser "
"syntetiseret over 1 dag og NDVI.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Tidsmæssig opløsning**: Daglig\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed**: Globalt fra oktober 2018\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse**: Overvågning af land og sikkerhed, overvågning af "
"klimaændringer"

msgid ""
"**The Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** is a combination of the OLCI and SLSTR "
"acquisitions with original objective to provide surface vegetation "
"products. [The Level-2 "
"V10](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products) product "
"contains 1 km VEGETATION-like product, 10 day synthesis surface "
"reflectances and NDVI.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Temporal resolution**: 10-days composite\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: Global since October 2018\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage**: Land Monitoring and Security, Climate Change Monitoring"
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** er en kombination af OLCI- og SLSTR-optagelser med "
"det oprindelige formål at levere produkter om overfladevegetation. [Level-2 "
"V10](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products)-produktet "
"indeholder et VEGETATION-lignende produkt på 1 km, overfladereflektanser "
"syntetiseret over 10 dage og NDVI.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Tidsmæssig opløsning**: 10-dages kompositbillede\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed**: Globalt fra oktober 2018\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse**: Overvågning af land og sikkerhed, overvågning af "
"klimaændringer"

msgid ""
"The **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** instrument on board "
"Sentinel-3 measures the global and regional sea and land surface "
"temperature. The SLSTR L2 Land Surface Temperature (LST) product provides "
"land surface temperature retrieved from the thermal infrared channels.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 1km (that is, only details bigger than 1km can be "
"seen).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 1 day to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2018 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Climate change monitoring, land surface temperature "
"monitoring, drought monitoring, urban heat island studies."
msgstr ""
"Instrumentet **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** om bord på "
"Sentinel-3 måler den globale og regionale temperatur på hav- og "
"landoverflader. SLSTR L2 Land Surface Temperature (LST)-produktet leverer "
"landoverfladetemperatur udledt fra de termiske infrarøde kanaler.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** 1 km (det vil sige, at kun detaljer, der er større "
"end 1 km, kan ses).\n"
"\n"
"**Gentagelsestid:** Højst 1 dag til at besøge det samme område igen ved "
"brug af begge satellitter.\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** Fra maj 2018 og frem.\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse:** Overvågning af klimaændringer, overvågning af "
"landoverfladetemperatur, overvågning af tørke, undersøgelser af "
"varmeøeffekt i byer."

msgid ""
"**Sentinel-2** provides high-resolution images in the visible and infrared "
"wavelengths, to monitor vegetation, soil and water cover, inland waterways "
"and coastal areas.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 10m, 20m, and 60m, depending on the wavelength "
"(that is, only details bigger than 10m, 20m, and 60m can be seen). More "
"info "
"[here](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/user-guides/sentinel-2-msi/"
"resolutions/spatial). \n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** maximum 5 days to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since June 2015. Full global coverage since March "
"2017.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Land-cover maps, land-change detection maps, vegetation "
"monitoring, monitoring of burnt areas."
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-2** leverer billeder i høj opløsning i de synlige og infrarøde "
"bølgelængder til overvågning af vegetation, jord- og vanddække, indre "
"vandveje og kystområder.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** 10 m, 20 m og 60 m afhængigt af bølgelængden (det vil "
"sige, at kun detaljer, der er større end 10 m, 20 m og 60 m, kan ses). "
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/user-guides/sentinel-2-msi/"
"resolutions/spatial). \n"
"\n"
"**Gentagelsestid:** højst 5 dage til at besøge det samme område igen ved "
"brug af begge satellitter.\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** Fra juni 2015. Fuld global dækning fra marts 2017.\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse:** Kort over arealdække, kort til opdagelse af "
"arealændringer, overvågning af vegetation, overvågning af afbrændte områder."

msgid ""
"Level 2A data are high quality data where the effects of the atmosphere on "
"the light being reflected off of the surface of the Earth and reaching the "
"sensor are excluded. Data are available globally since March 2017.\n"
"\n"
"More info about atmospheric correction "
"[here](https://www.sentinel-hub.com/develop/api/ogc/custom-parameters/"
"atmospheric-correction/)."
msgstr ""
"Level 2A-data er data af høj kvalitet, hvor atmosfærens påvirkning af det "
"lys, der reflekteres fra Jordens overflade og når sensoren, er udelukket. "
"Data er tilgængelige globalt fra marts 2017.\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger om atmosfærekorrektion "
"[her](https://www.sentinel-hub.com/develop/api/ogc/custom-parameters/"
"atmospheric-correction/)."

msgid ""
"Level 1C data are data of sufficient quality for most investigations, where "
"all image corrections were done except for the atmospheric correction. Data "
"are available globally since June 2015 onwards."
msgstr ""
"Level 1C-data er data af tilstrækkelig kvalitet til de fleste "
"undersøgelser, hvor alle billedkorrektioner er udført bortset fra "
"atmosfærekorrektionen. Data er tilgængelige globalt fra juni 2015 og frem."

msgid ""
"**Sentinel-1** provides all-weather, day and night radar imagery for land "
"and ocean services. EO\n"
"Browser provides data acquired in Interferometric Wide Swath (IW) and Extra "
"Wide Swath (EW) modes\n"
"processed to Level-1 Ground Range Detected (GRD).\n"
"\n"
"**Pixel spacing:** 10m (IW), 40m (EW).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** <= 5 days using both satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time** (for asc/desc and overlap using both satellites): <= 3 "
"days, see [observation "
"scenario](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/missions/sentinel-1/"
"observation-scenario)\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since October 2014.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Maritime and land monitoring, emergency response, climate "
"change."
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-1** leverer radarbilleder i al slags vejr, dag og nat, til land- "
"og havtjenester. EO\n"
"Browser leverer data indsamlet i tilstandene Interferometric Wide Swath "
"(IW) og Extra Wide Swath (EW),\n"
"behandlet til Level-1 Ground Range Detected (GRD).\n"
"\n"
"**Pixelafstand:** 10 m (IW), 40 m (EW).\n"
"\n"
"**Gentagelsestid:** <= 5 dage ved brug af begge satellitter.\n"
"\n"
"**Gentagelsestid** (for opadgående/nedadgående og overlap ved brug af begge "
"satellitter): <= 3 dage, se "
"[observationsscenarie](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/missions/"
"sentinel-1/observation-scenario)\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** Fra oktober 2014.\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse:** Overvågning af hav og land, katastrofeberedskab, "
"klimaændringer."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics** is a monthly composite obtained by "
"computing the local resolution weighted average of radiometrically and "
"geometrically terrain corrected input scenes. Due to the use of all "
"available data in a month, it contains less speckle (temporal average) and "
"the best possible local resolution (combination of ascending and descending "
"orbits).\n"
"\n"
"The input for the Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics are scenes with DH "
"polarization and can come from all acquisition modes.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Primarily polar and near-polar areas, as well as "
"ocean-relevant areas\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"The data for each month is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding month (e.g. 1.1. or 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** ~40 meters."
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics** er et månedligt kompositbillede, der fås "
"ved at beregne et lokalt opløsningsvægtet gennemsnit af radiometrisk og "
"geometrisk terrænkorrigerede inputscener. Fordi alle tilgængelige data i en "
"måned anvendes, indeholder det mindre speckle (tidsmæssigt gennemsnit) og "
"den bedst mulige lokale opløsning (kombination af opadgående og nedadgående "
"kredsløb).\n"
"\n"
"Inputtet til Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics er scener med DH-polarisering, "
"og de kan stamme fra alle optagelsestilstande.\n"
"\n"
"**Dækning:** Primært polare og næsten polare områder samt havrelevante "
"områder\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Dataene for hver måned er tilgængelige i kataloget den 1. dag i den "
"pågældende måned (f.eks. 1.1. eller 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** ~40 meter."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics** is a monthly composite obtained by "
"computing the local resolution weighted average of radiometrically and "
"geometrically terrain corrected input scenes. Due to the use of all "
"available data in a month, it contains less speckle (temporal average) and "
"the best possible local resolution (combination of ascending and descending "
"orbits).\n"
"\n"
"The input for the Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics are scenes taken in the IW "
"acquisition mode with DV polarization.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Over land and coastal areas (mainly between 80°N and 56°S)\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"The data for each month is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding month (e.g. 1.1. or 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** ~20 meters."
msgstr ""
"**Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics** er et månedligt kompositbillede, der fås "
"ved at beregne et lokalt opløsningsvægtet gennemsnit af radiometrisk og "
"geometrisk terrænkorrigerede inputscener. Fordi alle tilgængelige data i en "
"måned anvendes, indeholder det mindre speckle (tidsmæssigt gennemsnit) og "
"den bedst mulige lokale opløsning (kombination af opadgående og nedadgående "
"kredsløb).\n"
"\n"
"Inputtet til Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics er scener optaget i "
"optagelsestilstanden IW med DV-polarisering.\n"
"\n"
"**Dækning:** Over land og kystområder (hovedsageligt mellem 80°N og 56°S)\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Dataene for hver måned er tilgængelige i kataloget den 1. dag i den "
"pågældende måned (f.eks. 1.1. eller 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** ~20 meter."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **WorldCover Annual Cloudless Mosaics** product offers an almost "
"cloud-free image over the entire globe, created by stitching together the "
"cloudless Sentinel-2 images acquired over a one-year period at a spatial "
"resolution of 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"More information can be found "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/SentinelMissions/"
"Sentinel2.html#sentinel-2-level-2a-worldcover-annual-cloudless-mosaic-"
"rgbnir).\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Global Coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Data for each year is available in the catalog on the 1.1. of the "
"corresponding year.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Creating Basemaps, Land cover classification, "
"Infrastructure/Land use planning, Environmental monitoring, Water resource "
"management and more."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **WorldCover Annual Cloudless Mosaics** leverer et næsten skyfrit "
"billede over hele kloden, skabt ved at sammensætte de skyfrie "
"Sentinel-2-billeder, der er optaget over en periode på ét år, i en rumlig "
"opløsning på 10 meter.\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger findes "
"[her](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/SentinelMissions/"
"Sentinel2.html#sentinel-2-level-2a-worldcover-annual-cloudless-mosaic-"
"rgbnir).\n"
"\n"
"**Dækning:** Global dækning.\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Data for hvert år er tilgængelige i kataloget den 1.1. i det pågældende år.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** 10 meter.\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse:** Oprettelse af basiskort, klassifikation af "
"arealdække, planlægning af infrastruktur/arealanvendelse, miljøovervågning, "
"forvaltning af vandressourcer med mere."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-2 Quarterly Mosaics** product offers an almost cloud-free "
"image over the entire globe, created by stitching together the cloudless "
"Sentinel-2 images acquired over a quarterly period (every 3 months) at a "
"spatial resolution of 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Global Coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Data for each quarter is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding quarter (e.g. 1.1. or 1.4.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Creating Basemaps, Land cover classification, "
"Infrastructure/Land use planning, Environmental monitoring, Water resource "
"management and more."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **Sentinel-2 Quarterly Mosaics** leverer et næsten skyfrit "
"billede over hele kloden, skabt ved at sammensætte de skyfrie "
"Sentinel-2-billeder, der er optaget over en kvartalsperiode (hver 3. "
"måned), i en rumlig opløsning på 10 meter.\n"
"\n"
"**Dækning:** Global dækning.\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Data for hvert kvartal er tilgængelige i kataloget den 1. dag i det "
"pågældende kvartal (f.eks. 1.1. eller 1.4.).\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** 10 meter.\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse:** Oprettelse af basiskort, klassifikation af "
"arealdække, planlægning af infrastruktur/arealanvendelse, miljøovervågning, "
"forvaltning af vandressourcer med mere."

msgid "General complementary data information."
msgstr "Generelle supplerende dataoplysninger."

msgid ""
"The **Landsat 8-9** collection contains imagery from the two most recently "
"launched Landsat satellites (Landsat 8 and Landsat 9, provided by "
"NASA/USGS). Both carry the Operational Land Imager (OLI) and the Thermal "
"Infrared Sensor (TIRS), with 9 optical and 2 thermal bands. These two "
"sensors provide seasonal coverage of the global landmass.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 15 m for the panchromatic band and 30 m for the "
"rest (the thermal bands are re-sampled from 100 m).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** 16 days\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since January 2021\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Vegetation monitoring, land use, land cover maps, change "
"monitoring, etc.\n"
"\n"
"**Level-1** data (from **Landsat Collection 2**) provides global top of the "
"atmosphere reflectance and top of the atmosphere brightness temperature "
"products. \n"
"  \n"
"The data underwent several processing steps including geometric and "
"radiometric improvements. \n"
"  \n"
"More info about Level-1 data "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/SentinelHub/Data/"
"Landsat8-9.html)."
msgstr ""
"Kollektionen **Landsat 8-9** indeholder billeder fra de to senest opsendte "
"Landsat-satellitter (Landsat 8 og Landsat 9, leveret af NASA/USGS). Begge "
"bærer Operational Land Imager (OLI) og Thermal Infrared Sensor (TIRS) med 9 "
"optiske og 2 termiske bånd. Disse to sensorer giver sæsonbestemt dækning af "
"hele landjorden.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** 15 m for det pankromatiske bånd og 30 m for resten "
"(de termiske bånd er resamplet fra 100 m).\n"
"\n"
"**Gentagelsestid:** 16 dage\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed:** Fra januar 2021\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse:** Overvågning af vegetation, arealanvendelse, kort "
"over arealdække, overvågning af ændringer osv.\n"
"\n"
"**Level-1**-data (fra **Landsat Collection 2**) leverer globale produkter "
"med reflektans og lysstyrketemperatur i toppen af atmosfæren. \n"
"  \n"
"Dataene har gennemgået flere behandlingstrin, herunder geometriske og "
"radiometriske forbedringer. \n"
"  \n"
"Flere oplysninger om Level-1-data "
"[her](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/SentinelHub/Data/"
"Landsat8-9.html)."

msgid ""
"Global, cloud-free, and reconstructed historical Landsat spectral bands are "
"provided at a spatial resolution of 30 meters and temporal resolution of "
"bimonthly intervals from 1997 onwards. The dataset was generated using the "
"GLAD Landsat ARD version 2 as the primary input for temporal aggregation "
"and the imputation of missing values."
msgstr ""
"Globale, skyfrie og rekonstruerede historiske Landsat-spektralbånd leveres "
"i en rumlig opløsning på 30 meter og en tidsmæssig opløsning med to "
"måneders intervaller fra 1997 og frem. Datasættet blev genereret med GLAD "
"Landsat ARD version 2 som det primære input til tidsmæssig aggregering og "
"imputering af manglende værdier."

msgid ""
"A **DEM** (Digital Elevation Model) is a digital representation of a "
"terrain (usually Earth's surface). It is obtained by dividing the whole "
"globe into grid cells, each holding a corresponding altitude value in "
"meters. Depending on the gride cell size, a DEM can be more detailed (high "
"resolution) or less detailed (low resolution). Sentinel Hub DEM data "
"collections are static (independent of date) and globally available.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Modelling water flows, orthorectification of Sentinel-1 "
"imagery and engineering."
msgstr ""
"En **DEM** (Digital Elevation Model, digital højdemodel) er en digital "
"repræsentation af et terræn (normalt Jordens overflade). Den fås ved at "
"opdele hele kloden i gitterceller, hver med en tilsvarende højdeværdi i "
"meter. Afhængigt af gittercellernes størrelse kan en DEM være mere "
"detaljeret (høj opløsning) eller mindre detaljeret (lav opløsning). "
"Sentinel Hub DEM-datakollektioner er statiske (uafhængige af dato) og "
"tilgængelige globalt.\n"
"\n"
"**Almindelig anvendelse:** Modellering af vandstrømme, ortorektificering af "
"Sentinel-1-billeder og ingeniørarbejde."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Copernicus DEM** represents the surface of the Earth including "
"buildings, infrastructure and vegetation. Similar to the Mapzen DEM, it is "
"based on a combination of different DEMs (basis "
"[WorldDEMTM](https://www.geospatialworld.net/article/worlddemtm-new-"
"standard-of-global-elevation-models/)). It is a static collection "
"(independent of date) with global coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 30 m infilled with 90 m (where 30 m tiles are not "
"released).\n"
"\n"
"Credits: [ESA](${ COPERNICUS_CREDITS_URL })"
msgstr ""
"**Copernicus DEM** repræsenterer Jordens overflade inklusive bygninger, "
"infrastruktur og vegetation. Ligesom Mapzen DEM er den baseret på en "
"kombination af forskellige DEM'er (med "
"[WorldDEMTM](https://www.geospatialworld.net/article/worlddemtm-new-"
"standard-of-global-elevation-models/) som grundlag). Det er en statisk "
"kollektion (uafhængig af dato) med global dækning.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** 30 m udfyldt med 90 m (hvor 30 m-felter ikke er "
"frigivet).\n"
"\n"
"Kreditering: [ESA](${ COPERNICUS_CREDITS_URL })"

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Copernicus DEM** represents the surface of the Earth including "
"buildings, infrastructure and vegetation. Similar to the Mapzen DEM, it is "
"based on a combination of different DEMs (basis "
"[WorldDEMTM](https://www.geospatialworld.net/article/worlddemtm-new-"
"standard-of-global-elevation-models/)). It is a static collection "
"(independent of date) with global coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 90 m\n"
"\n"
"Credits: [ESA](${ COPERNICUS_CREDITS_URL })"
msgstr ""
"**Copernicus DEM** repræsenterer Jordens overflade inklusive bygninger, "
"infrastruktur og vegetation. Ligesom Mapzen DEM er den baseret på en "
"kombination af forskellige DEM'er (med "
"[WorldDEMTM](https://www.geospatialworld.net/article/worlddemtm-new-"
"standard-of-global-elevation-models/) som grundlag). Det er en statisk "
"kollektion (uafhængig af dato) med global dækning.\n"
"\n"
"**Rumlig opløsning:** 90 m\n"
"\n"
"Kreditering: [ESA](${ COPERNICUS_CREDITS_URL })"

msgid "Credits:"
msgstr "Krediteringer:"

msgid ""
"Geographical information on land cover and its changes, land use, ground "
"motion, vegetation state, water cycle and earth surface energy variables "
"for both Europe and the entire globe. Visit the [CLMS "
"website](https://land.copernicus.eu/en) for more information."
msgstr ""
"Geografiske oplysninger om arealdække og dets ændringer, arealanvendelse, "
"jordbevægelser, vegetationstilstand, vandkredsløb og energivariabler for "
"jordoverfladen for både Europa og hele kloden. Besøg "
"[CLMS-webstedet](https://land.copernicus.eu/en) for flere oplysninger."

msgid ""
"Provides at global level spatial information on different types (classes) "
"of physical coverage of the Earth's surface, e.g. forests, grasslands, "
"croplands, lakes, wetlands for the 2019 base year. The data are updated "
"annually and are available for the 2015-2019 years. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer på globalt niveau rumlige oplysninger om forskellige typer "
"(klasser) af fysisk dække på Jordens overflade, f.eks. skove, græsarealer, "
"dyrkede arealer, søer og vådområder for basisåret 2019. Dataene opdateres "
"årligt og er tilgængelige for årene 2015-2019. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover)."

msgid ""
"Provides a statistical overview of the land surface temperature over each "
"10-day compositing period regardless of any specific hour and every "
"geostationary sensor image pixel. The data are available at global scale in "
"the spatial resolution of about 5 km and covers the period from January "
"2017 to January 2021. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"-daily-land-surface-temperature-thermal-condition-index-global-v1-0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Giver et statistisk overblik over landoverfladetemperaturen for hver "
"10-dages kompositperiode uafhængigt af et bestemt tidspunkt på dagen og for "
"hver pixel i geostationære sensorers billeder. Dataene er tilgængelige i "
"global skala i en rumlig opløsning på omkring 5 km og dækker perioden fra "
"januar 2017 til januar 2021. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10-"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-thermal-condition-index-global-v1-0-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides a statistical overview of the land surface temperature daily cycle "
"for each 10-day compositing period and every geostationary sensor image "
"pixel. The data are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of "
"about 5 km and covers the period from January 2017 to January 2021. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"-daily-land-surface-temperature-daily-cycle-global-v1-0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Giver et statistisk overblik over det daglige forløb i "
"landoverfladetemperaturen for hver 10-dages kompositperiode og for hver "
"pixel i geostationære sensorers billeder. Dataene er tilgængelige i global "
"skala i en rumlig opløsning på omkring 5 km og dækker perioden fra januar "
"2017 til januar 2021. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10-"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-daily-cycle-global-v1-0-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides hourly land surface temperature from geostationary sensors "
"observations. The data are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of about 5 km and covers the period from July 2010 to January "
"2021. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"hourly-land-surface-temperature-global-v1-0-5km). \n"
"\n"
"*Please note that under default settings, the dataset displayed for each "
"day is the latest image available, which typically reflects the data "
"captured up to midnight. To access data from a specific hour, use the "
"\"Date: time range\" mode."
msgstr ""
"Leverer landoverfladetemperatur pr. time fra observationer med "
"geostationære sensorer. Dataene er tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig "
"opløsning på omkring 5 km og dækker perioden fra juli 2010 til januar 2021. "
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"hourly-land-surface-temperature-global-v1-0-5km). \n"
"\n"
"*Bemærk, at det datasæt, der som standard vises for hver dag, er det "
"seneste tilgængelige billede, som typisk afspejler de data, der er "
"indsamlet frem til midnat. For at få adgang til data fra et bestemt "
"tidspunkt på dagen skal du bruge tilstanden \"Dato: tidsrum\"."

