"opløsning på ~300 m. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information on the relative water content of the top few "
"centimeters soil, describing how wet or dry the soil is in its topmost "
"layer, expressed in percent saturation. Daily observations are available "
"for the continental Europe in the spatial resolution of 1 km and with the "
"temporal extent from October 2014 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-surface-"
"soil-moisture-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Giver oplysninger om det relative vandindhold i jordens øverste få "
"centimeter og beskriver, hvor våd eller tør jorden er i sit øverste lag, "
"udtrykt i procent mætning. Daglige observationer er tilgængelige for det "
"kontinentale Europa i en rumlig opløsning på 1 km og med en tidsmæssig "
"udstrækning fra oktober 2014 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-surface-"
"soil-moisture-v1.0)."

msgid ""
"Maps burn scars, surfaces which have been sufficiently affected by fire to "
"display significant changes in the vegetation cover (destruction of dry "
"material, reduction or loss of green material) and in the ground surface "
"(temporarily darker because of ash). Monthly datasets are available at "
"global scale, in the spatial resolution of 300 m, and with a time lag of "
"two months. They cover the period from 2019 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/burnt-area-v3-1-"
"monthly-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Kortlægger brandar, overflader der er blevet tilstrækkeligt påvirket af "
"brand til at udvise betydelige ændringer i vegetationsdækket (ødelæggelse "
"af tørt materiale, reduktion eller tab af grønt materiale) og i "
"jordoverfladen (midlertidigt mørkere på grund af aske). Månedlige datasæt "
"er tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig opløsning på 300 m og med en "
"tidsforsinkelse på to måneder. De dækker perioden fra 2019 til 2025. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/burnt-area-v3-1-"
"monthly-300m)."

msgid ""
"Maps burn scars, surfaces which have been sufficiently affected by fire to "
"display significant changes in the vegetation cover (destruction of dry "
"material, reduction or loss of green material) and in the ground surface "
"(temporarily darker because of ash). Monthly datasets are available at "
"global scale, in the spatial resolution of 300 m, and with a time lag of "
"two months. They cover the period from July 2018 to present. More "
"information _coming soon_."
msgstr ""
"Kortlægger brandar, overflader der er blevet tilstrækkeligt påvirket af "
"brand til at udvise betydelige ændringer i vegetationsdækket (ødelæggelse "
"af tørt materiale, reduktion eller tab af grønt materiale) og i "
"jordoverfladen (midlertidigt mørkere på grund af aske). Månedlige datasæt "
"er tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig opløsning på 300 m og med en "
"tidsforsinkelse på to måneder. De dækker perioden fra juli 2018 til i dag. "
"Flere oplysninger _kommer snart_."

msgid ""
"Maps burn scars, surfaces which have been sufficiently affected by fire to "
"display significant changes in the vegetation cover (destruction of dry "
"material, reduction or loss of green material) and in the ground surface "
"(temporarily darker because of ash). Daily datasets are available at global "
"scale, in the spatial resolution of 300 m, and within 24 hours after the "
"satellite acquisition. They cover the period from July 2023 to 2025. More "
"info "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/burnt-area-v3-1-"
"daily-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Kortlægger brandar, overflader der er blevet tilstrækkeligt påvirket af "
"brand til at udvise betydelige ændringer i vegetationsdækket (ødelæggelse "
"af tørt materiale, reduktion eller tab af grønt materiale) og i "
"jordoverfladen (midlertidigt mørkere på grund af aske). Daglige datasæt er "
"tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig opløsning på 300 m og inden for 24 "
"timer efter satellittens dataindsamling. De dækker perioden fra juli 2023 "
"til 2025. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/burnt-area-v3-1-"
"daily-300m)."

msgid ""
"Maps burn scars, surfaces which have been sufficiently affected by fire to "
"display significant changes in the vegetation cover (destruction of dry "
"material, reduction or loss of green material) and in the ground surface "
"(temporarily darker because of ash). Daily datasets are available at global "
"scale, in the spatial resolution of 300 m, and within 24 hours after the "
"satellite acquisition. They cover the period from December 2024 to present. "
"More information _coming soon_."
msgstr ""
"Kortlægger brandar, overflader der er blevet tilstrækkeligt påvirket af "
"brand til at udvise betydelige ændringer i vegetationsdækket (ødelæggelse "
"af tørt materiale, reduktion eller tab af grønt materiale) og i "
"jordoverfladen (midlertidigt mørkere på grund af aske). Daglige datasæt er "
"tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig opløsning på 300 m og inden for 24 "
"timer efter satellittens dataindsamling. De dækker perioden fra december "
"2024 til i dag. Flere oplysninger _kommer snart_."

msgid ""
"Provide at global scale and for Europe information on vegetation phenology "
"and productivity gathering 13 parameters  for two growing seasons. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer i global skala og for Europa oplysninger om vegetationens fænologi "
"og produktivitet, der samler 13 parametre for to vækstsæsoner. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."

msgid ""
"Provides at global scale and for Europe information on vegetation phenology "
"and productivity gathering 13 parameters for two growing seasons. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer i global skala og for Europa oplysninger om vegetationens fænologi "
"og produktivitet, der samler 13 parametre for to vækstsæsoner. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."

msgid ""
"Provides the total amount of carbon compounds produced by photosynthesis of "
"plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time. 10-daily observations are "
"available at global scale in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2023 to 2026. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer den samlede mængde kulstofforbindelser, der produceres ved planters "
"fotosyntese i et økosystem i en given periode. 10-dages observationer er "
"tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig opløsning på 300 m og med en "
"tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 2023 til 2026. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Defined as half the total area of green elements of the canopy per unit "
"horizontal ground area. Every 10-days estimates are available in near real "
"time at global scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from January "
"2014 to June 2020 based upon PROBA-V data with version 1.0 and from July "
"2020 onwards based upon Sentinel-3/OLCI data with version 1.1. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-300"
"m-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Defineret som halvdelen af den samlede overflade af kronedækkets grønne "
"elementer pr. enhed vandret jordareal. Estimater for hver 10. dag er "
"tilgængelige i næsten realtid i global skala i en rumlig opløsning på "
"omkring 300 m fra januar 2014 til juni 2020 baseret på PROBA-V-data med "
"version 1.0 og fra juli 2020 og frem baseret på Sentinel-3/OLCI-data med "
"version 1.1. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-300"
"m-v1.0)."

msgid ""
"Defined as half the total area of green elements of the canopy per unit "
"horizontal ground area. Every 10-days estimates are available in near real "
"time at global scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from January "
"2014 to June 2020 based upon PROBA-V data with version 1.0 and from July "
"2020 to 2026 based upon Sentinel-3/OLCI data with version 1.1. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-300"
"m-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Defineret som halvdelen af den samlede overflade af kronedækkets grønne "
"elementer pr. enhed vandret jordareal. Estimater for hver 10. dag er "
"tilgængelige i næsten realtid i global skala i en rumlig opløsning på "
"omkring 300 m fra januar 2014 til juni 2020 baseret på PROBA-V-data med "
"version 1.0 og fra juli 2020 til 2026 baseret på Sentinel-3/OLCI-data med "
"version 1.1. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-300"
"m-v1.0)."

msgid ""
"Provides the amount of carbon retained in an ecosystem (increase in "
"biomass); it is equal to the difference between the amount of carbon "
"produced through photosynthesis (GPP) and the amount of energy that is used "
"for respiration (R). 10-daily observations are available at global scale in "
"the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"2026. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Angiver mængden af kulstof, der bindes i et økosystem (stigning i "
"biomasse); den er lig med forskellen mellem den mængde kulstof, der "
"produceres gennem fotosyntese (GPP), og den mængde energi, der bruges til "
"respiration (R). 10-dages observationer er tilgængelige i global skala i en "
"rumlig opløsning på 300 m og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 2023 til "
"2026. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, a spectral index "
"quantifying the amount and vigour of vegetation. Every 10-days, estimates "
"are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~1km from January "
"1999 to June 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, et spektralindeks, der "
"kvantificerer mængden og livskraften af vegetation. Estimater for hver 10. "
"dag er tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig opløsning på ~1 km fra "
"januar 1999 til juni 2020. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Averages the daily Soil Water Index product over 10 days. The data are "
"produced every 10 days over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."
msgstr ""
"Beregner gennemsnittet af det daglige Soil Water Index-produkt over 10 "
"dage. Dataene produceres hver 10. dag for hele kloden i en rumlig opløsning "
"på 0,1° og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra januar 2007 til 2025. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."

msgid ""
"Provides daily updates on the moisture conditions in different soil layers. "
"The data are available over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Giver daglige opdateringer om fugtforholdene i forskellige jordlag. Dataene "
"er tilgængelige for hele kloden i en rumlig opløsning på 0,1° og med en "
"tidsmæssig udstrækning fra januar 2007 til 2025. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-water-"
"index-global-v3-0-12-5km)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the moisture condition at various depths in the soil. Daily "
"observations are available for the continental Europe in the spatial "
"resolution of 1 km and with the temporal extent from January 2015 to 2025. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Kvantificerer fugtforholdene på forskellige dybder i jorden. Daglige "
"observationer er tilgængelige for det kontinentale Europa i en rumlig "
"opløsning på 1 km og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra januar 2015 til "
"2025. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-water-"
"index-europe-v1-0-1km)."

#. LOT2
msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water providing the maximum and the "
"minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal dynamics. "
"10-daly data are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of 300 "
"m and with the temporal extent from 2014 to 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Opdager de områder, der er dækket af indre vandområder, og angiver "
"vandoverfladens maksimale og minimale udstrækning samt den sæsonbestemte "
"dynamik. 10-dages data er tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig opløsning "
"på 300 m og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 2014 til 2020. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water providing the maximum and the "
"minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal dynamics. "
"Monthly updates are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of "
"300 m and with the temporal extent from 2020 to present More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Opdager de områder, der er dækket af indre vandområder, og angiver "
"vandoverfladens maksimale og minimale udstrækning samt den sæsonbestemte "
"dynamik. Månedlige opdateringer er tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig "
"opløsning på 300 m og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 2020 til i dag. "
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides for the Northern Hemisphere daily updates of the equivalent amount "
"of liquid water stored in the snow pack. The data is available in the "
"spatial resolution of 5 km and with the temporal extent from January 2006 "
"to June 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v1-"
"0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer daglige opdateringer for den nordlige halvkugle af den tilsvarende "
"mængde flydende vand, der er lagret i snedækket. Dataene er tilgængelige i "
"en rumlig opløsning på 5 km og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra januar "
"2006 til juni 2024. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v1-0"
"-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for the Northern Hemisphere daily updates of the equivalent amount "
"of liquid water stored in the snow pack. The data is available in near real "
"time in the spatial resolution of 5 km and with the temporal extent from "
"July 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v2-"
"0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer daglige opdateringer for den nordlige halvkugle af den tilsvarende "
"mængde flydende vand, der er lagret i snedækket. Dataene er tilgængelige i "
"næsten realtid i en rumlig opløsning på 5 km og med en tidsmæssig "
"udstrækning fra juli 2024 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v2-0"
"-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for Europe daily updates of the fraction of snow cover on the "
"ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%). The "
"data is available in near real time in the spatial resolution of 500 m and "
"with the temporal extent from March 2017 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-europe-"
"v1-0-500m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer for Europa daglige opdateringer af andelen af snedække på jorden "
"(også i skovklædte områder) pr. pixel i procent (0 % – 100 %). Dataene er "
"tilgængelige i næsten realtid i en rumlig opløsning på 500 m og med en "
"tidsmæssig udstrækning fra marts 2017 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-europe-"
"v1-0-500m)."

msgid ""
"Provides for Northern Hemisphere daily maps of the fraction of snow cover "
"on ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%). The "
"data is available in near real time with a pixel spacing of about 1 km and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2018 to 2026. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer for den nordlige halvkugle daglige kort over andelen af snedække på "
"jorden (også i skovklædte områder) pr. pixel i procent (0 % – 100 %). "
"Dataene er tilgængelige i næsten realtid med en pixelafstand på omkring 1 "
"km og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra januar 2018 til 2026. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-v1-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for global land areas (excluding Antarctica) daily maps of the "
"fraction of snow cover on ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in "
"percentage (0% – 100%). The data is available in near real time with a "
"pixel spacing of about 1 km and with the temporal extent from December 2025 "
"to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-global-v1-0-1"
"km)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer for globale landområder (undtagen Antarktis) daglige kort over "
"andelen af snedække på jorden (også i skovklædte områder) pr. pixel i "
"procent (0 % – 100 %). Dataene er tilgængelige i næsten realtid med en "
"pixelafstand på omkring 1 km og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra december "
"2025 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-global-v1-0-1"
"km)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis classifies pixels in Northern Hemisphere freshwater bodies "
"into 1) Ice, 2) Open water, and 3) Cloud. The class “Ice” includes various "
"types of ice, also snow-covered ice. The data is updated in near real-time "
"with the spatial resolution of 500 m and with a temporal extent from April "
"2021 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-500m)."
msgstr ""
"Klassificerer dagligt pixels i ferskvandsområder på den nordlige halvkugle "
"som 1) Is, 2) Åbent vand og 3) Sky. Klassen \"Is\" omfatter forskellige "
"typer is, også snedækket is. Dataene opdateres i næsten realtid med en "
"rumlig opløsning på 500 m og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra april 2021 "
"til 2025. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-500m)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis, classifies pixels of Continental Europe freshwater bodies "
"as 1) Fully snow-covered ice, 2) Partially snow-covered or snow-free ice, "
"and 3) Open water. The data is available in near real time in a spatial "
"resolution of 250 m and with the temporal extent from July the 1st, "
"onwards. In June 2024, the data input sensor was transferred from Terra "
"MODIS (VERSION 1.2.1) to NOAA-20 VIIRS (VERSION 2.2.1), and the area was "
"extended from the Baltic region to cover Continental Europe. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"europe-v2-250m)."
msgstr ""
"Klassificerer dagligt pixels i ferskvandsområder i det kontinentale Europa "
"som 1) Helt snedækket is, 2) Delvist snedækket eller snefri is og 3) Åbent "
"vand. Dataene er tilgængelige i næsten realtid i en rumlig opløsning på 250 "
"m og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 1. juli og frem. I juni 2024 blev "
"datainputsensoren skiftet fra Terra MODIS (VERSION 1.2.1) til NOAA-20 VIIRS "
"(VERSION 2.2.1), og området blev udvidet fra Østersøregionen til at dække "
"det kontinentale Europa. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"europe-v2-250m)."

msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water along the year providing the "
"maximum and the minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal "
"dynamics. Monthly updates are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of 100 m and with the temporal extent from 2020 to present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Opdager de områder, der er dækket af indre vandområder i løbet af året, og "
"angiver vandoverfladens maksimale og minimale udstrækning samt den "
"sæsonbestemte dynamik. Månedlige opdateringer er tilgængelige i global "
"skala i en rumlig opløsning på 100 m og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra "
"2020 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes. 10-daily observations are available in near real time at "
"300 m spatial resolution from September 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-near-real-time-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer semikontinuerlige observationer for et stort antal mellemstore og "
"store søer. 10-dages observationer er tilgængelige i næsten realtid i en "
"rumlig opløsning på 300 m fra september 2024 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-near-real-time-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2002 to 2012. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer semikontinuerlige observationer for et stort antal mellemstore og "
"store søer i henhold til Global Lakes and Wetlands Database (GLWD) eller af "
"anden grund af særlig interesse for miljøovervågning. 10-dages "
"observationer er tilgængelige i en rumlig opløsning på 300 m og med en "
"tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 2002 til 2012. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2016 to 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer semikontinuerlige observationer for et stort antal mellemstore og "
"store søer i henhold til Global Lakes and Wetlands Database (GLWD) eller af "
"anden grund af særlig interesse for miljøovervågning. 10-dages "
"observationer er tilgængelige i en rumlig opløsning på 300 m og med en "
"tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 2016 til 2024. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in near real time in the spatial resolution of "
"100 m and with the temporal extent from 2019 to 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v1-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer semikontinuerlige observationer for et stort antal mellemstore og "
"store søer i henhold til Global Lakes and Wetlands Database (GLWD) eller af "
"anden grund af særlig interesse for miljøovervågning. 10-dages "
"observationer er tilgængelige i næsten realtid i en rumlig opløsning på 100 "
"m og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 2019 til 2024. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v1-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides spatial information at global level on different types (classes) "
"of physical coverage of the Earth's surface, e.g. forests, grasslands, "
"croplands, water bodies, wetlands for the base year 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products?tab=full_coverage_land_cover__"
"use)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer rumlige oplysninger på globalt niveau om forskellige typer "
"(klasser) af fysisk dække på Jordens overflade, f.eks. skove, græsarealer, "
"dyrkede arealer, vandområder og vådområder for basisåret 2020. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products?tab=full_coverage_land_cover__"
"use)."

msgid ""
"Provides yearly tree cover density for the pantropical region at 10 m "
"resolution, expressed as percentage of tree cover. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover/"
"tree-cover-density-2020-raster-10-m-pantropical-annual)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer årlig trædækketæthed for den pantropiske region i 10 m opløsning, "
"udtrykt som procent trædække. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover/tree-"
"cover-density-2020-raster-10-m-pantropical-annual)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis classifies pixels in Global freshwater bodies into 1) "
"Snow-covered ice, 2) Partially snow-covered or snow-free ice, 3) Open "
"water, and 4) Cloud. The data is updated in near-real time with the spatial "
"resolution of 500 m and with a temporal extent from July 2025 to present. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"global-500m_v2)."
msgstr ""
"Klassificerer dagligt pixels i globale ferskvandsområder som 1) Snedækket "
"is, 2) Delvist snedækket eller snefri is, 3) Åbent vand og 4) Sky. Dataene "
"opdateres i næsten realtid med en rumlig opløsning på 500 m og med en "
"tidsmæssig udstrækning fra juli 2025 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"global-500m_v2)."

msgid ""
"Provides daily updates on the moisture conditions in different soil layers. "
"The data are available over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from 2007 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-12-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Giver daglige opdateringer om fugtforholdene i forskellige jordlag. Dataene "
"er tilgængelige for hele kloden i en rumlig opløsning på 0,1° og med en "
"tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 2007 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-water-"
"index-global-12-5km)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the moisture condition at various depths in the soil. Daily "
"observations are available for the continental Europe in the spatial "
"resolution of 1 km and with the temporal extent from July 2025 to present. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Kvantificerer fugtforholdene på forskellige dybder i jorden. Daglige "
"observationer er tilgængelige for det kontinentale Europa i en rumlig "
"opløsning på 1 km og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra juli 2025 til i dag. "
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-water-"
"index-europe-1km)."

msgid ""
"Averages the daily Soil Water Index product over 10 days. The data are "
"produced every 10 days over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."
msgstr ""
"Beregner gennemsnittet af det daglige Soil Water Index-produkt over 10 "
"dage. Dataene produceres hver 10. dag for hele kloden i en rumlig opløsning "
"på 0,1° og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra januar 2007 til i dag. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."

msgid ""
"On daily basis for the Northern Europe classifies, in pixels, "
"inland/freshwater bodies as 1) Fully snow-covered ice, 2) Partially "
"snow-covered or snow-free ice, 3) Open water. The data is available in near "
"real time in the spatial resolution of 250 m and with the temporal extent "
"from March 2017 to 30 June 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"baltic-v1-250m)."
msgstr ""
"Klassificerer dagligt for Nordeuropa, pixel for pixel, indre "
"vandområder/ferskvandsområder som 1) Helt snedækket is, 2) Delvist "
"snedækket eller snefri is, 3) Åbent vand. Dataene er tilgængelige i næsten "
"realtid i en rumlig opløsning på 250 m og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra "
"marts 2017 til 30. juni 2024. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"baltic-v1-250m)."

msgid ""
"Provides actual evapotranspiration, soil evaporation and canopy "
"transpiration with some quality indicators. Estimates are provided for two "
"evapotranspiration schemes and an Ensemble of models. Every 10-days "
"estimate are available in near real time at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of about 300 m from November 2025 onwards in version 1.0. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/"
"evapotranspiration-2025-present-raster-300m-global-10-daily-version-1)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer faktisk evapotranspiration, jordfordampning og kronetranspiration "
"med nogle kvalitetsindikatorer. Estimater leveres for to "
"evapotranspirationsskemaer og et ensemble af modeller. Estimater for hver "
"10. dag er tilgængelige i næsten realtid i global skala i en rumlig "
"opløsning på omkring 300 m fra november 2025 og frem i version 1.0. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/"
"evapotranspiration-2025-present-raster-300m-global-10-daily-version-1)."

msgid ""
"Provides latent and sensible heat fluxes with one auxiliary information. "
"Estimates are provided for each Sentinel-3 overpass in near real time at "
"global scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from November 2025 "
"onwards in version 1.0. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/heat-flux-2"
"025-present-raster-300-m-global-daily-version-1)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer latente og følbare varmestrømme med én hjælpeoplysning. Estimater "
"leveres for hver Sentinel-3-overflyvning i næsten realtid i global skala i "
"en rumlig opløsning på omkring 300 m fra november 2025 og frem i version "
"1.0. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/heat-flux-20"
"25-present-raster-300-m-global-daily-version-1)."

msgid ""
"Provides the temperature of the water at the lake surface. The LSWT "
"observations (every 10 days) are available at global scale at spatial "
"resolution of ~1 km and with the temporal extent from 2002 to 2012. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-offline-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer temperaturen på vandet ved søens overflade. LSWT-observationerne "
"(hver 10. dag) er tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig opløsning på ~1 "
"km og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 2002 til 2012. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-offline-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides the temperature of the water at the lake surface. The near real "
"time observations (every 10 days) are available at global scale at spatial "
"resolution of ~1 km and with the temporal extent from 2016 to present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-near-real-time-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer temperaturen på vandet ved søens overflade. Observationerne i "
"næsten realtid (hver 10. dag) er tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig "
"opløsning på ~1 km og med en tidsmæssig udstrækning fra 2016 til i dag. "
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-near-real-time-v1-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in near real time at 100 m spatial resolution "
"from September 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v2-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer semikontinuerlige observationer for et stort antal mellemstore og "
"store søer i henhold til Global Lakes and Wetlands Database (GLWD) eller af "
"anden grund af særlig interesse for miljøovervågning. 10-dages "
"observationer er tilgængelige i næsten realtid i en rumlig opløsning på 100 "
"m fra september 2024 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v2-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about Leaf Area Index, defined as half the total area "
"of green elements of the canopy per unit horizontal ground area. Every "
"10-days estimates are available at global scale in the spatial resolution "
"of ~300 m from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2-"
"0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer oplysninger om bladarealindeks, defineret som halvdelen af den "
"samlede overflade af kronedækkets grønne elementer pr. enhed vandret "
"jordareal. Estimater for hver 10. dag er tilgængelige i global skala i en "
"rumlig opløsning på ~300 m fra januar 2014 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2-0"
"-300m)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the fraction of the solar radiation absorbed by live plants for "
"photosynthesis. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale, in "
"the spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Kvantificerer den andel af solstrålingen, der absorberes af levende planter "
"til fotosyntese. Estimater for hver 10. dag er tilgængelige i global skala "
"i en rumlig opløsning på ~300 m fra januar 2014 til i dag. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information of the fraction of ground covered by green vegetation. "
"Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of ~ 300 m from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-green-"
"vegetation-cover-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer oplysninger om den andel af jorden, der er dækket af grøn "
"vegetation. Estimater for hver 10. dag er tilgængelige i global skala i en "
"rumlig opløsning på ~300 m fra januar 2014 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-green-"
"vegetation-cover-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2018 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover data for 764 "
"Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the 2018 "
"reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans countries, as "
"well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2018 leverer pålidelige, "
"sammenlignelige arealdække- og arealanvendelsesdata i høj opløsning for 764 "
"funktionelle byområder (FUA) med mere end 50.000 indbyggere for "
"referenceåret 2018 i EEA38-landene (EU, EFTA, lande på det vestlige Balkan "
"samt Türkiye) og Det Forenede Kongerige. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2021 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover data for 790 "
"Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the 2021 "
"reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans countries, as "
"well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2021 leverer pålidelige, "
"sammenlignelige arealdække- og arealanvendelsesdata i høj opløsning for 790 "
"funktionelle byområder (FUA) med mere end 50.000 indbyggere for "
"referenceåret 2021 i EEA38-landene (EU, EFTA, lande på det vestlige Balkan "
"samt Türkiye) og Det Forenede Kongerige. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use Change 2018-2021 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover change data for "
"764 Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the "
"2021 reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans "
"countries, as well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use Change 2018-2021 leverer pålidelige, "
"sammenlignelige data i høj opløsning om ændringer i arealdække og "
"arealanvendelse for 764 funktionelle byområder (FUA) med mere end 50.000 "
"indbyggere for referenceåret 2021 i EEA38-landene (EU, EFTA, lande på det "
"vestlige Balkan samt Türkiye) og Det Forenede Kongerige. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Street Tree Layer 2021 provides information about presence of "
"trees within Functional Urban Areas (FUA). More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Street Tree Layer 2021 leverer oplysninger om forekomsten af "
"træer inden for funktionelle byområder (FUA). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Provides detailed land cover and land use information for 59 thematic "
"classes in selected Natura2000 and Emerald sites for the 2021 reference "
"year. The dataset has a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.5 ha and a Minimum "
"Mapping Width (MMW) of 10 m and is available as vector data. More "
"information [here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/n2k)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer detaljerede oplysninger om arealdække og arealanvendelse for 59 "
"tematiske klasser i udvalgte Natura2000- og Emerald-områder for "
"referenceåret 2021. Datasættet har en Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) på 0,5 ha "
"og en Minimum Mapping Width (MMW) på 10 m og er tilgængeligt som "
"vektordata. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/n2k)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the overall growth rate, or net dry biomass "
"increase, of the vegetation. It is equivalent to Net Primary Production "
"(NPP) but expressed in kg of dry matter per hectare and per day. Every "
"10-days, estimates are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution "
"of ~300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer oplysninger om vegetationens samlede vækstrate eller nettostigning "
"i tørstof. Den svarer til nettoprimærproduktion (NPP), men udtrykt i kg "
"tørstof pr. hektar og pr. dag. Estimater for hver 10. dag er tilgængelige i "
"global skala i en rumlig opløsning på ~300 m fra januar 2014 til i dag. "
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the total amount of carbon compounds produced by "
"photosynthesis of plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time, "
"expressed in gC/m²/day. Every 10-days, estimates are available at global "
"scale, at a spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the "
"present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer oplysninger om den samlede mængde kulstofforbindelser, der "
"produceres ved planters fotosyntese i et økosystem i en given periode, "
"udtrykt i gC/m²/dag. Estimater for hver 10. dag er tilgængelige i global "
"skala i en rumlig opløsning på ~300 m fra januar 2014 til i dag. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the net amount of biomass, or carbon, produced "
"by plants per unit area and time, expressed in gC/m²/day. It is equal to "
"the difference between the Gross Primary Production (GPP), i.e. the total "
"amount of carbon produced through photosynthesis, and the amount of energy "
"used for plant respiration. Every 10-days, estimates are available at "
"global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the "
"present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer oplysninger om nettomængden af biomasse eller kulstof, som planter "
"producerer pr. arealenhed og tid, udtrykt i gC/m²/dag. Den er lig med "
"forskellen mellem bruttoprimærproduktionen (GPP), dvs. den samlede mængde "
"kulstof produceret gennem fotosyntese, og den energi, der bruges til "
"planters respiration. Estimater for hver 10. dag er tilgængelige i global "
"skala i en rumlig opløsning på ~300 m fra januar 2014 til i dag. Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the total amount of dry matter produced by land "
"plants per unit time through photosynthesis. It is equivalent to Gross "
"Primary Production (GPP) but expressed in kg of dry matter per hectare and "
"per day. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale, at a "
"spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer oplysninger om den samlede mængde tørstof, som landplanter "
"producerer pr. tidsenhed gennem fotosyntese. Den svarer til "
"bruttoprimærproduktion (GPP), men udtrykt i kg tørstof pr. hektar og pr. "
"dag. Estimater for hver 10. dag er tilgængelige i global skala i en rumlig "
"opløsning på ~300 m fra januar 2014 til i dag. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Dominant Leaf Type (DLT) raster product provides a "
"basic land cover classification with 3 thematic classes (all non-tree "
"covered areas, broadleaved and coniferous).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for "
"the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)"
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Dominant Leaf Type (DLT) leverer en "
"grundlæggende klassifikation af arealdække med 3 tematiske klasser (alle "
"områder uden trædække, løvtræer og nåletræer).\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2018 i 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest er en del af Den "
"Europæiske Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er "
"tilgængeligt for datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier (DOM'er)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land Presence (CPFLP) "
"raster product provides the yearly fallow land classification indicating if "
"arable land has been left fallow in the respective calendar year. This "
"dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries. High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the "
"European Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer "
"available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land "
"Presence (CPFLP) leverer den årlige klassifikation af brakjord, som "
"angiver, om dyrkbar jord er blevet lagt brak i det pågældende kalenderår. "
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene. Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del "
"af Den Europæiske Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag "
"er tilgængeligt for datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil After (CPBSA) "
"raster product provides bare soil period (in days) after the harvest of the "
"main annual crop. Note that the bare soil period cannot transcend the "
"calendar year for which the product is generated.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil After "
"(CPBSA) angiver perioden med bar jord (i dage) efter høsten af den "
"vigtigste etårige afgrøde. Bemærk, at perioden med bar jord ikke kan "
"strække sig ud over det kalenderår, som produktet er genereret for.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land Duration (CPFLD) "
"raster product provides information on the duration of fallow land periods, "
"expressed in days, over a five-year period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"Note: each product covers a five-year window and is referenced by the end "
"year of that window (e.g. the 2021 product covers the period 2017–2021).\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land "
"Duration (CPFLD) leverer oplysninger om varigheden af perioder med "
"brakjord, udtrykt i dage, over en femårig periode.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Bemærk: hvert produkt dækker et femårigt vindue og refereres til ved "
"slutåret for dette vindue (f.eks. dækker 2021-produktet perioden "
"2017–2021).\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil Before (CPBSB) "
"raster product provides the bare soil period (in days) before the emergence "
"of the main annual crop. Note that the bare soil period cannot transcend "
"the calendar year for which the product is generated.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil Before "
"(CPBSB) angiver perioden med bar jord (i dage) før fremspiringen af den "
"vigtigste etårige afgrøde. Bemærk, at perioden med bar jord ikke kan "
"strække sig ud over det kalenderår, som produktet er genereret for.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Dominant Leaf Type Change (DLTC) raster provides "
"information on the change between two reference years, and consists of 5 "
"thematic classes (new broadleaved cover / new coniferous cover / loss of "
"broadleaved cover / loss of coniferous cover / unchanged areas with tree "
"cover). This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 and "
"2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"The production of the high resolution forest layers was coordinated by the "
"European Environment Agency (EEA) in the frame of the EU Copernicus "
"programme.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Rasteren High Resolution Layer Dominant Leaf Type Change (DLTC) leverer "
"oplysninger om ændringen mellem to referenceår og består af 5 tematiske "
"klasser (nyt løvtrædække / nyt nåletrædække / tab af løvtrædække / tab af "
"nåletrædække / uændrede områder med trædække). Dette datasæt dækker to "
"sammenligningsperioder, 2018-2021 og 2021-2024, hvor hvert produkt er "
"dateret efter slutåret for sin sammenligningsperiode.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres i 20 meter-rastere (fuldt i overensstemmelse med "
"EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktionen af skovlagene i høj opløsning blev koordineret af Det "
"Europæiske Miljøagentur (EEA) inden for rammerne af EU's "
"Copernicus-program.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Crop Types (CTY) raster product provides high "
"resolution crop type classification for 17 classes of both arable and "
"permanent crops across the EEA38 extent. Using both Sentinel-1 and "
"Sentinel-2, the model is finetuned to first map the crop field boundaries, "
"and then determine the main crop for each field.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Crop Types (CTY) leverer en "
"afgrødetypeklassifikation i høj opløsning for 17 klasser af både enårige og "
"permanente afgrøder i hele EEA38-området. Ved hjælp af både Sentinel-1 og "
"Sentinel-2 er modellen finjusteret til først at kortlægge markgrænserne og "
"derefter bestemme hovedafgrøden for hver mark.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Duration (CPMCD) "
"raster product provides the duration (in days) of the growing season for "
"the main (annual) crop.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries. High Resolution Layer Croplands product is "
"part of the European Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence "
"layer available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop "
"Duration (CPMCD) angiver varigheden (i dage) af vækstsæsonen for "
"hovedafgrøden (den etårige).\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene. Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del "
"af Den Europæiske Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag "
"er tilgængeligt for datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The Copernicus High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Presence Change (TCPC) "
"raster product provides information on the change between two reference "
"years, and consists of 3 thematic classes (new tree cover / loss of tree "
"cover / unchanged areas with tree cover). The class 255 = outside area is "
"predefined by the 100m boundary layer and remains unchanged. This layer for "
"previous reference year comparisons is called Tree Cover Change Mask "
"(TCCM). This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 and "
"2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"The production of the high resolution forest layers was coordinated by the "
"European Environment Agency (EEA) in the frame of the EU Copernicus "
"programme. Confidence layer available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet Copernicus High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Presence Change "
"(TCPC) leverer oplysninger om ændringen mellem to referenceår og består af "
"3 tematiske klasser (nyt trædække / tab af trædække / uændrede områder med "
"trædække). Klassen 255 = område uden for er foruddefineret af 100 "
"m-grænselaget og forbliver uændret. Dette lag for tidligere "
"referenceårssammenligninger kaldes Tree Cover Change Mask (TCCM). Dette "
"datasæt dækker to sammenligningsperioder, 2018-2021 og 2021-2024, hvor "
"hvert produkt er dateret efter slutåret for sin sammenligningsperiode.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres i 20 meter-rastere (fuldt i overensstemmelse med "
"EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktionen af skovlagene i høj opløsning blev koordineret af Det "
"Europæiske Miljøagentur (EEA) inden for rammerne af EU's "
"Copernicus-program. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Change (GRAC) raster product at 20m "
"resolution provides information on changes in grassland vegetation cover. "
"The thematic classes indicate all non-grassland areas, grassland gain and "
"grassland loss, unchanged grassland in both years and unverified grassland "
"gain and loss areas. This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 "
"and 2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Grassland Change (GRAC) i 20 m "
"opløsning leverer oplysninger om ændringer i græsarealernes "
"vegetationsdække. De tematiske klasser angiver alle områder uden græs, "
"tilvækst og tab af græsarealer, uændrede græsarealer i begge år samt "
"ubekræftede områder med tilvækst og tab af græsarealer. Dette datasæt "
"dækker to sammenligningsperioder, 2018-2021 og 2021-2024, hvor hvert "
"produkt er dateret efter slutåret for sin sammenligningsperiode.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres i 20 meter-rastere (fuldt i overensstemmelse med "
"EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Grasslands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) provides a forest "
"classification with 3 thematic classes (all non-forest areas / broadleaved "
"forest / coniferous forest) at 10m spatial resolution and with a Minimum "
"Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.5 ha. This raster layer is largely following the "
"FAO (Food and Agriculture Organisation of the United Nations) forest "
"definition with tree covered areas in agricultural and urban context "
"excluded using the respective Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)"
msgstr ""
"High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) leverer en skovklassifikation med 3 "
"tematiske klasser (alle områder uden skov / løvskov / nåleskov) i 10 m "
"rumlig opløsning og med en Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) på 0,5 ha. Dette "
"rasterlag følger i vid udstrækning FAO's (De Forenede Nationers Fødevare- "
"og Landbrugsorganisation) skovdefinition, hvor trædækkede områder i "
"landbrugs- og bymæssig sammenhæng er udelukket ved hjælp af det respektive "
"Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL).\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres med en frekvens på hvert 3. år i 10 meter-rastere "
"(fuldt i overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 "
"km, der dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest er en del af Den "
"Europæiske Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier (DOM'er)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) raster product provides a binary "
"status layer of grassland/non-grassland mask. This grassy and non-woody "
"vegetation baseline product includes all kinds of grasslands: managed "
"grassland, semi-natural grassland and natural grassy vegetation. It does "
"not include temporary grasslands, which are masked out using the "
"corresponding Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH), indicating on the number of "
"years since a pixel was last ploughed.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) leverer et binært "
"statuslag med en maske for græsareal/ikke-græsareal. Dette basisprodukt for "
"græsklædt og ikke-træagtig vegetation omfatter alle slags græsarealer: "
"forvaltede græsarealer, seminaturlige græsarealer og naturlig "
"græsvegetation. Det omfatter ikke midlertidige græsarealer, som maskeres ud "
"ved hjælp af den tilsvarende pløjningsindikator (PLOUGH), der angiver "
"antallet af år siden en pixel sidst blev pløjet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Grasslands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) dataset provides "
"information on the proportional crown coverage per pixel at 10 meter "
"spatial resolution and ranges from 0% (all non-tree covered areas) to 100%, "
"whereby Tree Cover Density is defined as the \"vertical projection of tree "
"crowns to a horizontal earth’s surface\".\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for "
"the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)."
msgstr ""
"Datasættet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) leverer "
"oplysninger om den proportionale kronedækning pr. pixel i 10 meter rumlig "
"opløsning og spænder fra 0 % (alle områder uden trædække) til 100 %, hvor "
"trædækketæthed defineres som \"den lodrette projektion af trækroner på en "
"vandret jordoverflade\".\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2018 i 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest er en del af Den "
"Europæiske Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er "
"tilgængeligt for datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH) raster product "
"continues the 2015 and 2018 PLOUGH Layer following a rolling archive "
"principle by adding current information and removing historic years. It "
"indicates the number of years since the last indication of ploughing within "
"the permanent grassland area. PLOUGH is derived by taking into account the "
"series of binary HER layers, the BVL classifications and HR VPP PPI (Plant "
"Phenology Index) quantiles. BVL classes 4 (crop) and 7 (overlaying layer "
"between herbaceous and crop) indicate a ploughing event. Low HR VPP PPI "
"quantiles indicate low vegetation at a certain time of the year. For years "
"with missing information (2016 and earlier) the ploughing information from "
"the historic PLOUGH product is considered which causes some issues.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH) "
"viderefører PLOUGH-laget fra 2015 og 2018 efter et rullende arkivprincip "
"ved at tilføje aktuelle oplysninger og fjerne historiske år. Det angiver "
"antallet af år siden den seneste indikation af pløjning inden for det "
"permanente græsareal. PLOUGH udledes ved at tage hensyn til rækken af "
"binære HER-lag, BVL-klassifikationerne og HR VPP PPI-kvantiler (Plant "
"Phenology Index). BVL-klasse 4 (afgrøde) og 7 (overlejrende lag mellem "
"urteagtig vegetation og afgrøde) angiver en pløjehændelse. Lave HR VPP "
"PPI-kvantiler angiver lav vegetation på et bestemt tidspunkt af året. For "
"år med manglende oplysninger (2016 og tidligere) anvendes "
"pløjeoplysningerne fra det historiske PLOUGH-produkt, hvilket giver nogle "
"problemer.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Grasslands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 is a 10 m high resolution raster "
"layer containing height information generated for selected cities and urban "
"areas as part of the Urban atlas suite of products. Height information is "
"based on satellite information and derived datasets like the digital "
"surface model, the digital terrain model and the normalized digital surface "
"model (DSM). More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 er et rasterlag i 10 m høj opløsning "
"med højdeoplysninger genereret for udvalgte byer og byområder som en del af "
"produktpakken Urban Atlas. Højdeoplysningerne er baseret på "
"satellitoplysninger og afledte datasæt som den digitale overflademodel, den "
"digitale terrænmodel og den normaliserede digitale overflademodel (DSM). "
"Flere oplysninger [her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Type (CPSCT) "
"raster product indicates if a cover crop was present within the respective "
"calendar year and further segregates the types of cover crop into: short "
"summer, long summer, short winter and long winter cover crop.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Type (CPSCT) angiver, om der var en dækafgrøde til stede inden for det "
"pågældende kalenderår, og inddeler yderligere dækafgrødetyperne i: kort "
"sommerdækafgrøde, lang sommerdækafgrøde, kort vinterdækafgrøde og lang "
"vinterdækafgrøde.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Dates (GRAMD) raster product "
"provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 10 m a basic "
"land cover classification, flagging and mapping the start date (DOY) "
"(GRAMD) within the detected Herbaceous cover layer (temporal and permanent "
"grassland)) with a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.25 ha. The GRAMD product "
"will flag and map the dates (Day of Year) of each mowing event on temporary "
"or permanent grassland per year, resulting in a product split in four "
"different rasters per year.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2017 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Dates (GRAMD) "
"leverer på paneuropæisk niveau i 10 m rumlig opløsning en grundlæggende "
"klassifikation af arealdække, der markerer og kortlægger startdatoen (DOY) "
"(GRAMD) inden for det detekterede lag med urteagtigt dække (midlertidige og "
"permanente græsarealer) med en Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) på 0,25 ha. "
"GRAMD-produktet markerer og kortlægger datoerne (dag i året) for hver "
"slåningshændelse på midlertidige eller permanente græsarealer pr. år, "
"hvilket resulterer i et produkt opdelt i fire forskellige rastere pr. år.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 i 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Grasslands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons Types "
"(CPCSY) raster product provides the number of different crop types grown in "
"a 3-year period [0-3] (excluding cover crops).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons "
"Types (CPCSY) angiver antallet af forskellige afgrødetyper, der dyrkes i en "
"3-årig periode [0-3] (ekskl. dækafgrøder).\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Events (GRAME) raster product "
"provides a basic land cover classification containing respectively the "
"number of grassland mowing events within the detected Herbaceous cover "
"layer (temporal and permanent grassland) with a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) "
"of 0.25 ha. The GRAME product will flag and map the number of mowing events "
"(1, 2, 3, or 4+) on temporary or permanent grassland detected per year.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Events (GRAME) "
"leverer en grundlæggende klassifikation af arealdække, der indeholder "
"antallet af slåningshændelser på græsarealer inden for det detekterede lag "
"med urteagtigt dække (midlertidige og permanente græsarealer) med en "
"Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) på 0,25 ha. GRAME-produktet markerer og "
"kortlægger antallet af slåningshændelser (1, 2, 3 eller 4+) på midlertidige "
"eller permanente græsarealer, der er registreret pr. år.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Grasslands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Herbaceous cover (HER) raster product provides a "
"basic land cover classification with 2 thematic classes (temporal and "
"permanent herbaceous / non-herbaceous). The production of the herbaceous "
"layer is primarily based on the probability estimates obtained from the "
"Base Vegetation Layer (BVL) which also serves to harmonize the different "
"vegetated HRL products (Grasslands, Tree Cover and Forests, Croplands). HER "
"is further used as input for the Grassland status layer (GRA) extracting "
"the permanent herbaceous in combination with the Ploughing indicator "
"(PLOUGH).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Herbaceous cover (HER) leverer en "
"grundlæggende klassifikation af arealdække med 2 tematiske klasser "
"(midlertidigt og permanent urteagtigt / ikke-urteagtigt). Produktionen af "
"laget med urteagtigt dække er primært baseret på de "
"sandsynlighedsestimater, der opnås fra Base Vegetation Layer (BVL), som "
"også tjener til at harmonisere de forskellige HRL-produkter om vegetation "
"(Grasslands, Tree Cover and Forests, Croplands). HER bruges desuden som "
"input til statuslaget for græsarealer (GRA), hvor det permanente urteagtige "
"udtrækkes i kombination med pløjningsindikatoren (PLOUGH).\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Grasslands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons Yearly "
"(CPCSY) raster product provides number of growing seasons detected within 1 "
"year (0/1/2).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons "
"Yearly (CPCSY) angiver antallet af vækstsæsoner, der er registreret inden "
"for 1 år (0/1/2).\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-synthesis-global-v3-0-3km)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer estimater af landoverfladetemperatur i global skala i en rumlig "
"opløsning på ~3 km. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-synthesis-global-v3-0-3km)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-global-v3-0-3km)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer estimater af landoverfladetemperatur i global skala i en rumlig "
"opløsning på ~3 km. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-global-v3-0-3km)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-"
"reflectance?tab=land_surface_temperature)."
msgstr ""
"Leverer estimater af landoverfladetemperatur i global skala i en rumlig "
"opløsning på ~3 km. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-"
"reflectance?tab=land_surface_temperature)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Emergence "
"(CPSCE) raster product provides the date of emergence of the cover crop in "
"days of the year (DOY). YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the year (e.g. 19 "
"for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365)\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Emergence (CPSCE) angiver datoen for dækafgrødens fremspiring i dage i året "
"(DOY). ÅÅDOY, hvor ÅÅ = årets sidste 2 cifre (f.eks. 19 for 2019), og DOY "
"er dagen i året (1-365)\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) provides "
"information on trees under agricultural use or in urban context to be "
"excluded from the Forest Type (FTY) product and at 10m spatial resolution. "
"The derivation of Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) is based on the "
"spatial intersection of the 10m DLT and TCD layers with CORINE Land Cover "
"(CLC) 2018 and HRL Imperviousness Degree 2018 with 10 m spatial resolution; "
"TCD range of 10-100%; with a MMW of 10m and no MMU (pixel base).\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries.\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"High Resolution Layer Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) leverer "
"oplysninger om træer under landbrugsmæssig anvendelse eller i bymæssig "
"sammenhæng, som skal udelukkes fra produktet Forest Type (FTY), i 10 m "
"rumlig opløsning. Udledningen af Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) er "
"baseret på den rumlige overlapning af 10 m DLT- og TCD-lagene med CORINE "
"Land Cover (CLC) 2018 og HRL Imperviousness Degree 2018 med 10 m rumlig "
"opløsning; TCD-interval på 10-100 %; med en MMW på 10 m og ingen MMU "
"(pixelbaseret).\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres med en frekvens på hvert 3. år i 10 meter-rastere "
"(fuldt i overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 "
"km, der dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest er en del af Den "
"Europæiske Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Duration "
"(CPSCD) raster product provides the duration (in days) of the cover crop "
"season (can exceed the calendar year).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Duration (CPSCD) angiver varigheden (i dage) af dækafgrødesæsonen (kan "
"strække sig ud over kalenderåret).\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The Cloud Classification (CC) product provides information on the extent of "
"clouds and cloud shadows derived from optical satellite data acquired by "
"the **Sentinel-2** constellation. Cloud detection is performed at a "
"**120m** spatial resolution using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a pixel spacing of 20 m "
"x 20 m. It used to produce the CLMS High-Resolution Water, Snow and Ice "
"datasets (HR-WSI), which rely on Sentinel-2 imagery.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. No product is generated for a "
"Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds 90%.<br><br>More information in "
"the products documentation "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Produktet Cloud Classification (CC) leverer oplysninger om udbredelsen af "
"skyer og skyggen fra skyer, udledt af optiske satellitdata indsamlet af "
"konstellationen **Sentinel-2**. Skydetektionen udføres i en rumlig "
"opløsning på **120 m** ved hjælp af "
"[MAJA-softwaren](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Det "
"genereres i næsten realtid på europæisk skala med en pixelafstand på 20 m x "
"20 m. Det bruges til at producere CLMS' datasæt om vand, sne og is i høj "
"opløsning (HR-WSI), som bygger på "
"Sentinel-2-billeder.<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: fra 2016 til i dag. Der "
"genereres intet produkt for et Sentinel-2-felt, når skydækket overstiger 90 "
"%.<br><br>Flere oplysninger i produkternes dokumentation "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The **Fractional Snow Cover (FSC)** product provides the fraction of the "
"surface covered by snow at the top of canopy (FSC-TOC) and on ground "
"(FSC-OG) per pixel as a percentage (0% – 100%). Cloud detection in the "
"Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale based on optical satellite "
"data from the **Sentinel-2** constellation, with a spatial resolution of "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No "
"product is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **Fractional Snow Cover (FSC)** leverer andelen af overfladen, "
"der er dækket af sne i toppen af kronedækket (FSC-TOC) og på jorden "
"(FSC-OG), pr. pixel som en procentdel (0 % – 100 %). Skydetektion i "
"Sentinel-2-billederne udføres ved hjælp af "
"[MAJA-softwaren](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Det "
"genereres i næsten realtid på europæisk skala baseret på optiske "
"satellitdata fra konstellationen **Sentinel-2** med en rumlig opløsning på "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: fra 2016 til i dag. Der "
"genereres intet produkt for et Sentinel-2-felt, når skydækket overstiger 90 "
"%.<br><br>Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The **SAR Wet Snow (SWS)** product provides the wet snow extent for high "
"mountain areas, based on C-band Synthetic Aperture Radar satellite data "
"from the **Sentinel-1** constellation.<br><br>It is generated in near "
"real-time for selected high mountain areas at European scale with a spatial "
"resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to "
"the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-sar-wet-"
"snow)."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **SAR Wet Snow (SWS)** leverer udbredelsen af våd sne i "
"højtliggende bjergområder, baseret på C-bånd Synthetic Aperture "
"Radar-satellitdata fra konstellationen **Sentinel-1**.<br><br>Det genereres "
"i næsten realtid for udvalgte højtliggende bjergområder på europæisk skala "
"med en rumlig opløsning på **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: "
"fra 2016 til i dag.<br><br>Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-sar-wet-"
"snow)."

msgid ""
"The **Wet / Dry Snow (WDS)** product provides information on the snow state "
"(wet or dry) by combining **Sentinel-1** radar-based wet snow maps within "
"the snow cover extent derived from **Sentinel-2** optical data. Cloud "
"detection in the Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a spatial resolution of "
"**60 m x 60 m** in areas where Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 observation tracks "
"overlap.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No product "
"is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-wet-dry-"
"snow)."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **Wet / Dry Snow (WDS)** leverer oplysninger om snetilstanden "
"(våd eller tør) ved at kombinere radarbaserede kort over våd sne fra "
"**Sentinel-1** inden for den snedækningsudbredelse, der er udledt af "
"optiske **Sentinel-2**-data. Skydetektion i Sentinel-2-billederne udføres "
"ved hjælp af "
"[MAJA-softwaren](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Det "
"genereres i næsten realtid på europæisk skala med en rumlig opløsning på "
"**60 m x 60 m** i områder, hvor Sentinel-1- og "
"Sentinel-2-observationssporene overlapper.<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: "
"fra 2016 til i dag. Der genereres intet produkt for et Sentinel-2-felt, når "
"skydækket overstiger 90 %.<br><br>Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-wet-dry-"
"snow)."

msgid ""
"The daily cumulative **Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover (GFSC)** product "
"provides pixel-wise snow cover extent as a percentage (0% – 100%). It is "
"based on synthetic aperture radar (SAR) data from the **Sentinel-1** "
"constellation and optical imagery from the **Sentinel-2** constellation. "
"The product is generated by merging all available Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 "
"observations acquired over the previous **seven days** to produce a "
"spatially complete composite of snow conditions, thereby reducing data gaps "
"caused by cloud cover and sensor coverage limitations. Snow information "
"derived from Sentinel-1 is focused on the detection of wet snow in "
"high-mountain areas.<br><br>It is generated on a daily basis at European "
"scale, with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-gap-"
"filled-fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Det daglige kumulative produkt **Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover (GFSC)** "
"leverer pixelvis snedækningsudbredelse som en procentdel (0 % – 100 %). Det "
"er baseret på Synthetic Aperture Radar (SAR)-data fra konstellationen "
"**Sentinel-1** og optiske billeder fra konstellationen **Sentinel-2**. "
"Produktet genereres ved at flette alle tilgængelige Sentinel-1- og "
"Sentinel-2-observationer, der er indsamlet i løbet af de foregående **syv "
"dage**, til et rumligt komplet kompositbillede af snetilstanden og dermed "
"reducere datahuller forårsaget af skydække og begrænsninger i sensorernes "
"dækning. Sneoplysninger udledt af Sentinel-1 fokuserer på detektion af våd "
"sne i højtliggende bjergområder.<br><br>Det genereres dagligt på europæisk "
"skala med en rumlig opløsning på **60 m x 60 "
"m**.<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: fra 2016 til i dag.<br><br>Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-gap-"
"filled-fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S2)** product characterizes the timing "
"and duration of the snow season. For each pixel and for a given "
"hydrological year, it provides the number of days with snow cover, as well "
"as the first and last day of the longest continuous snow period. The "
"hydrological year starts on 1 September.<br><br>The product is generated at "
"the European scale with a spatial resolution of **20 m x 20 m**, consistent "
"with the input snow cover maps derived from optical satellite data acquired "
"by the Sentinel-2 constellation (Fractional Snow Cover - "
"FSC).<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can "
"be downloaded in multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."
msgstr ""
"Sentinel-2-produktet **Snow Phenology (SP S2)** karakteriserer snesæsonens "
"tidspunkt og varighed. For hver pixel og for et givet hydrologisk år "
"angiver det antallet af dage med snedække samt første og sidste dag i den "
"længste sammenhængende sneperiode. Det hydrologiske år begynder den 1. "
"september.<br><br>Produktet genereres på europæisk skala med en rumlig "
"opløsning på **20 m x 20 m**, i overensstemmelse med de inputkort over "
"snedække, der er udledt af optiske satellitdata indsamlet af "
"konstellationen Sentinel-2 (Fractional Snow Cover - "
"FSC).<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: fra 2016 til i dag. Dataene kan "
"downloades i flere projektioner og pixelafstande.<br><br>Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."

msgid ""
"The Sentinel-1 & Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S1+S2)** product "
"characterizes the timing and duration of the snow season. For each pixel "
"and for a given hydrological year, it provides the number of days with snow "
"cover, as well as the first and last day of the longest continuous snow "
"period. The hydrological year starts on 1 September.<br><br>The product is "
"generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 "
"m**, consistent with the input snow cover maps derived from optical "
"satellite data acquired by the Sentinel-2 constellation and from C-band "
"Synthetic Aperture Radar satellite data acquired by the Sentinel-1 "
"constellation (Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover - GFSC).<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."
msgstr ""
"Sentinel-1- og Sentinel-2-produktet **Snow Phenology (SP S1+S2)** "
"karakteriserer snesæsonens tidspunkt og varighed. For hver pixel og for et "
"givet hydrologisk år angiver det antallet af dage med snedække samt første "
"og sidste dag i den længste sammenhængende sneperiode. Det hydrologiske år "
"begynder den 1. september.<br><br>Produktet genereres på europæisk skala "
"med en rumlig opløsning på **60 m x 60 m**, i overensstemmelse med de "
"inputkort over snedække, der er udledt af optiske satellitdata indsamlet af "
"konstellationen Sentinel-2 og af C-bånd Synthetic Aperture "
"Radar-satellitdata indsamlet af konstellationen Sentinel-1 (Gap-filled "
"Fractional Snow Cover - GFSC).<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: fra 2016 til "
"i dag. Dataene kan downloades i flere projektioner og "
"pixelafstande.<br><br>Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."

msgid ""
"The **Water Cover Duration (WCD)** product estimates the number of days "
"land is covered by water. For each pixel and for a given hydrological year, "
"it indicates how frequently water is present. The hydrological year starts "
"on 1 September. It is based on water masks derived from **Sentinel-1** "
"radar and **Sentinel-2** optical data, combined with Water/Ice Cover data "
"from Sentinel-2 (WIC S2).<br><br>The product is generated at the European "
"scale with a spatial resolution of **10 m x 10 m**.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-cover-duration)."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **Water Cover Duration (WCD)** estimerer antallet af dage, hvor "
"land er dækket af vand. For hver pixel og for et givet hydrologisk år "
"angiver det, hvor hyppigt vand er til stede. Det hydrologiske år begynder "
"den 1. september. Det er baseret på vandmasker udledt af "
"**Sentinel-1**-radar og optiske **Sentinel-2**-data kombineret med data om "
"vand-/isdække fra Sentinel-2 (WIC S2).<br><br>Produktet genereres på "
"europæisk skala med en rumlig opløsning på **10 m x 10 "
"m**.<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: fra 2016 til i dag. Dataene kan "
"downloades i flere projektioner og pixelafstande.<br><br>Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-cover-duration)."

msgid ""
"The **Ice Cover Duration (ICD)** product describes how long inland waters "
"are covered by ice. For each pixel and for a given hydrological year, it "
"provides the number of days with ice cover. The hydrological year starts on "
"1 September. It is based on ice cover maps derived from **Sentinel-2** "
"optical data (Water/Ice Cover WIC S2) and **Sentinel-1** C-band Synthetic "
"Aperture Radar data (Water/Ice Cover WIC S1).<br><br>The product is "
"generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can "
"be downloaded in multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"ice-cover-duration)."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **Ice Cover Duration (ICD)** beskriver, hvor længe indre "
"vandområder er dækket af is. For hver pixel og for et givet hydrologisk år "
"angiver det antallet af dage med isdække. Det hydrologiske år begynder den "
"1. september. Det er baseret på kort over isdække udledt af optiske "
"**Sentinel-2**-data (Water/Ice Cover WIC S2) og **Sentinel-1** C-bånd "
"Synthetic Aperture Radar-data (Water/Ice Cover WIC S1).<br><br>Produktet "
"genereres på europæisk skala med en rumlig opløsning på **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: fra 2016 til i dag. Dataene kan "
"downloades i flere projektioner og pixelafstande.<br><br>Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"ice-cover-duration)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 (WICS1)** product provides "
"information about river and lake areas covered by snow-covered or snow-free "
"ice. It is based on synthetic aperture radar data from the **Sentinel-1** "
"constellation.<br><br>It is generated in near real-time at European scale, "
"with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: "
"from 2016 to the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 (WICS1)** leverer oplysninger "
"om flod- og søområder, der er dækket af snedækket eller snefri is. Det er "
"baseret på Synthetic Aperture Radar-data fra konstellationen "
"**Sentinel-1**.<br><br>Det genereres i næsten realtid på europæisk skala "
"med en rumlig opløsning på **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: "
"fra 2016 til i dag.<br><br>Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-2 (WICS2)** product provides the "
"water and ice extent over land. A water mask is used to differentiate "
"between snow on ice-covered water areas and snow on land. Cloud detection "
"in the Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale based on optical satellite "
"data from the Sentinel-2 constellation, with a spatial resolution of **20 m "
"x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No "
"product is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-2 (WICS2)** leverer udbredelsen "
"af vand og is over land. En vandmaske bruges til at skelne mellem sne på "
"isdækkede vandområder og sne på land. Skydetektion i Sentinel-2-billederne "
"udføres ved hjælp af "
"[MAJA-softwaren](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Det "
"genereres i næsten realtid på europæisk skala baseret på optiske "
"satellitdata fra konstellationen Sentinel-2 med en rumlig opløsning på **20 "
"m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: fra 2016 til i dag. Der "
"genereres intet produkt for et Sentinel-2-felt, når skydækket overstiger 90 "
"%.<br><br>Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 (WIC S1+S2)** "
"product shows which river and lake areas are covered by ice, with or "
"without snow. It combines data from two types of instruments acquired on "
"the same day to increase coverage and reduce missing information. It uses "
"water/ice cover information derived from **Sentinel-2** optical images (WIC "
"S2), and from **Sentinel-1** radar data (WIC S1).<br><br>The product is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a spatial resolution of "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the "
"present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 (WIC S1+S2)** "
"viser, hvilke flod- og søområder der er dækket af is, med eller uden sne. "
"Det kombinerer data fra to typer instrumenter, der er indsamlet samme dag, "
"for at øge dækningen og reducere manglende oplysninger. Det bruger "
"oplysninger om vand-/isdække udledt af optiske **Sentinel-2**-billeder (WIC "
"S2) og af **Sentinel-1**-radardata (WIC S1).<br><br>Produktet genereres i "
"næsten realtid på europæisk skala med en rumlig opløsning på **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Datatilgængelighed**: fra 2016 til i dag.<br><br>Flere "
"oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Broadleaved Density (BCD) dataset provides "
"information on the percentage of broadleaved pixels at 100m spatial "
"resolution, and is derived through aggregation of the 10m DLT for the "
"respective reference year. Within each cell the number of broadleaved "
"pixels are counted and the percentages stored into in the 100m pixel of the "
"BCD. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer "
"and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Datasættet High Resolution Layer Broadleaved Density (BCD) leverer "
"oplysninger om procentdelen af løvtræspixels i 100 m rumlig opløsning og er "
"udledt ved aggregering af 10 m DLT for det pågældende referenceår. Inden "
"for hver celle tælles antallet af løvtræspixels, og procentdelene gemmes i "
"BCD's 100 m-pixel. Klassen 255 = område uden for er foruddefineret af 100 "
"m-grænselaget og forbliver uændret.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2018 i 100 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest er en del af Den "
"Europæiske Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Coniferous Cover Density (CCD) dataset provides "
"information on the percentage of coniferous pixels at 100m spatial "
"resolution, and is derived through aggregation of the 10m DLT for the "
"respective reference year. Within each cell the number of coniferous pixels "
"are counted and the percentages stored into in the 100m pixel of the CCD. "
"The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer and "
"remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Datasættet High Resolution Layer Coniferous Cover Density (CCD) leverer "
"oplysninger om procentdelen af nåletræspixels i 100 m rumlig opløsning og "
"er udledt ved aggregering af 10 m DLT for det pågældende referenceår. Inden "
"for hver celle tælles antallet af nåletræspixels, og procentdelene gemmes i "
"CCD's 100 m-pixel. Klassen 255 = område uden for er foruddefineret af 100 "
"m-grænselaget og forbliver uændret.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2018 i 100 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest er en del af Den "
"Europæiske Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) dataset provides the Forest "
"Type estimation at 100 meter spatial resolution. The number of broadleaved "
"and coniferous pixels are counted and the percentages stored in the 100m "
"cell. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer "
"and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Datasættet High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) leverer estimatet af "
"skovtype i 100 meter rumlig opløsning. Antallet af løvtræs- og "
"nåletræspixels tælles, og procentdelene gemmes i 100 m-cellen. Klassen 255 "
"= område uden for er foruddefineret af 100 m-grænselaget og forbliver "
"uændret.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres med en frekvens på hvert 3. år i 100 meter-rastere "
"(fuldt i overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 "
"km, der dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest er en del af Den "
"Europæiske Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) raster product provides a binary "
"status layer of grassland/non-grassland mask. This grassy and non-woody "
"vegetation baseline product includes all kinds of grasslands: managed "
"grassland, semi-natural grassland and natural grassy vegetation. It does "
"not include temporary grasslands, which are masked out using the "
"corresponding Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH), indicating on the number of "
"years since a pixel was last ploughed. In the 100 meter raster product, the "
"number of Grassland pixels are counted and the percentages stored in each "
"100 meter cell. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m "
"boundary layer and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) leverer et binært "
"statuslag med en maske for græsareal/ikke-græsareal. Dette basisprodukt for "
"græsklædt og ikke-træagtig vegetation omfatter alle slags græsarealer: "
"forvaltede græsarealer, seminaturlige græsarealer og naturlig "
"græsvegetation. Det omfatter ikke midlertidige græsarealer, som maskeres ud "
"ved hjælp af den tilsvarende pløjningsindikator (PLOUGH), der angiver "
"antallet af år siden en pixel sidst blev pløjet. I 100 "
"meter-rasterproduktet tælles antallet af græsarealspixels, og procentdelene "
"gemmes i hver 100 meter-celle. Klassen 255 = område uden for er "
"foruddefineret af 100 m-grænselaget og forbliver uændret.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 100 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Grasslands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) dataset provides "
"information on the proportional crown coverage per pixel at 100 meter "
"spatial resolution and ranges from 0% (all non-tree covered areas) to 100%, "
"whereby Tree Cover Density is defined as the \"vertical projection of tree "
"crowns to a horizontal earth's surface\". This product is an aggregation of "
"its corresponding high resolution dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Datasættet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) leverer "
"oplysninger om den proportionale kronedækning pr. pixel i 100 meter rumlig "
"opløsning og spænder fra 0 % (alle områder uden trædække) til 100 %, hvor "
"trædækketæthed defineres som \"den lodrette projektion af trækroner på en "
"vandret jordoverflade\". Dette produkt er en aggregering af det tilsvarende "
"datasæt i høj opløsning.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2018 i 100 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest er en del af Den "
"Europæiske Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Emergence (CPMCE) "
"raster product provides the emergence date of the main (annual) crop "
"expressed in DOY (day of year). YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the year "
"(e.g. 19 for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop "
"Emergence (CPMCE) angiver fremspiringsdatoen for hovedafgrøden (den "
"etårige) udtrykt i DOY (dag i året). ÅÅDOY, hvor ÅÅ = årets sidste 2 cifre "
"(f.eks. 19 for 2019), og DOY er dagen i året (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Harvest (CPMCH) "
"raster product provides the harvest date of the main (annual) crop "
"expressed in days of the year (DOY). The harvest is considered as the time "
"of removal of most of the biomass. YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the "
"year (e.g. 19 for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rasterproduktet High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Harvest "
"(CPMCH) angiver høstdatoen for hovedafgrøden (den etårige) udtrykt i dage i "
"året (DOY). Høsten anses for at være tidspunktet for fjernelsen af "
"størstedelen af biomassen. ÅÅDOY, hvor ÅÅ = årets sidste 2 cifre (f.eks. 19 "
"for 2019), og DOY er dagen i året (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt leveres årligt fra 2017 med 10 meter-rastere (fuldt i "
"overensstemmelse med EEA's referencegitter) i felter på 100 x 100 km, der "
"dækker EEA38-landene.\n"
"\n"
"Produktet High Resolution Layer Croplands er en del af Den Europæiske "
"Unions Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Konfidenslag er tilgængeligt for "
"datasættet.\n"
"\n"
"Dette datasæt indeholder data fra de franske oversøiske territorier "
"(DOM'er). Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"This metadata refers to the CORINE Land Cover Plus Land Use, Land-Use "
"Change and Forestry Instance (CLCplus LULUCF Instance), an annually "
"updated, pan-European, spatially consistent and seamless geospatial proxy "
"for land use reporting under the LULUCF regulation. The product is "
"delivered as a single raster layer with a spatial resolution of 100 m, "
"derived from multiple pan-European Copernicus Land Monitoring Service "
"(CLMS) high resolution input datasets. The LULUCF Instance is available for "
"the reference years 2018, 2021, 2022 and 2023, with production moving to an "
"annual update cycle starting from the 2021 product. Each raster cell "
"represents a dominant LULUCF land-use class, assigned according to thematic "
"and spatial rulesets implemented during the extraction process. While each "
"pixel corresponds primarily to one of the six main LULUCF land use "
"categories - forest land, grassland, cropland, settlements, wetlands, and "
"other lands - the dataset further differentiates these categories into sub "
"classes, resulting in a total of 27 classes. This classification structure "
"supports greenhouse gas reporting and other applications within the LULUCF "
"sector by providing a harmonised and policy relevant representation of land "
"use across Europe. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/clcplus-lulucf-instance)."
msgstr ""
"Disse metadata vedrører CORINE Land Cover Plus Land Use, Land-Use Change "
"and Forestry Instance (CLCplus LULUCF Instance), en årligt opdateret, "
"paneuropæisk, rumligt konsistent og sømløs geospatial proxy til "
"rapportering om arealanvendelse under LULUCF-forordningen. Produktet "
"leveres som ét enkelt rasterlag med en rumlig opløsning på 100 m, udledt af "
"flere paneuropæiske inputdatasæt i høj opløsning fra Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service (CLMS). LULUCF Instance er tilgængelig for "
"referenceårene 2018, 2021, 2022 og 2023, hvor produktionen går over til en "
"årlig opdateringscyklus fra og med 2021-produktet. Hver rastercelle "
"repræsenterer en dominerende LULUCF-arealanvendelsesklasse, der er tildelt "
"i henhold til tematiske og rumlige regelsæt, som er implementeret under "
"udtrækningsprocessen. Mens hver pixel primært svarer til en af de seks "
"hovedkategorier for LULUCF-arealanvendelse - skovareal, græsareal, "
"dyrkningsareal, bebyggelse, vådområder og andre arealer - opdeler "
"datasættet yderligere disse kategorier i underklasser, hvilket giver i alt "
"27 klasser. Denne klassifikationsstruktur understøtter "
"drivhusgasrapportering og andre anvendelser inden for LULUCF-sektoren ved "
"at give en harmoniseret og politikrelevant repræsentation af "
"arealanvendelsen i hele Europa. Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/clcplus-lulucf-instance)."

msgid ""
"The **High Resolution Water Layer (HRWL)** product provides classified maps "
"showing permanent water, temporary water, dry areas, and sea water. It is a "
"multi-annual product, typically covering a **7-year period**, and is "
"updated every 3 years. It is based on the annual Water Cover Duration (WCD) "
"production, which combines water masks from **Sentinel-1** radar and "
"**Sentinel-2** optical imagery with Water/Ice Cover data from Sentinel-2 "
"(WIC S2).\n"
"\n"
"The product is generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of "
"**10 m × 10 m**.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: HRWL is available for the reference years 2021 and "
"2024, covering the periods **01/09/2016**–31/12/2021 and "
"**01/09/2018**–31/12/2024, respectively. The dataset can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.\n"
"\n"
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-layer)."
msgstr ""
"Produktet **High Resolution Water Layer (HRWL)** leverer klassificerede "
"kort, der viser permanent vand, midlertidigt vand, tørre områder og "
"havvand. Det er et flerårigt produkt, der typisk dækker en **7-årig "
"periode**, og opdateres hvert 3. år. Det er baseret på den årlige "
"produktion af Water Cover Duration (WCD), som kombinerer vandmasker fra "
"**Sentinel-1**-radar og optiske **Sentinel-2**-billeder med data om "
"vand-/isdække fra Sentinel-2 (WIC S2).\n"
"\n"
"Produktet genereres på europæisk skala med en rumlig opløsning på **10 m × "
"10 m**.\n"
"\n"
"**Datatilgængelighed**: HRWL er tilgængeligt for referenceårene 2021 og "
"2024 og dækker henholdsvis perioderne **01/09/2016**–31/12/2021 og "
"**01/09/2018**–31/12/2024. Datasættet kan downloades i flere projektioner "
"og pixelafstande.\n"
"\n"
"Flere oplysninger "
"[her](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-layer)."

msgid ""
"This dataset comprises one cloud-free Very High Resolution optical coverage "
"of 39 European States (EEA-39) including all islands of those countries "
"plus \n"
"the French Overseas Departments of French Guiana, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte and Réunion but excluding French Overseas Territories for a total "
"coverage \n"
"of ~ 6 million square kilometres. The area of interest is extended by a 4 "
"km buffer over the sea and a 500 m buffer over countries bordering the "
"EEA-39 states. \n"
"More "
"[info](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/VHR-IMAGE-2018)."
msgstr ""
"Dette datasæt omfatter én skyfri optisk dækning i meget høj opløsning af 39 "
"europæiske stater (EEA-39), herunder alle øer tilhørende disse lande samt \n"
"de franske oversøiske departementer Fransk Guyana, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte og Réunion, men ikke de franske oversøiske territorier, i alt en "
"dækning \n"
"på ~ 6 millioner kvadratkilometer. Interesseområdet er udvidet med en "
"bufferzone på 4 km over havet og 500 m over lande, der grænser op til "
"EEA-39-staterne. \n"
"Flere "
"[oplysninger](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/VHR-IMAGE-2018)."

