msgid ""
"The collection holds Level-2 Land Surface Temperature (LST) products from "
"OroraTech’s\n"
"FOREST satellites, at 200 m ground sampling distance, over selected "
"European pilot sites.\n"
"Each product is a Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF giving the land surface "
"temperature, in Kelvin.\n"
"Daytime and night-time acquisitions from complementary orbits make the "
"collection suited to\n"
"studying the daily temperature cycle, urban heat islands, drought and "
"surface water stress."
msgstr ""
"Kollektionen indeholder Level-2 Land Surface Temperature (LST)-produkter "
"fra OroraTechs\n"
"FOREST-satellitter i 200 m jordprøvetagningsafstand over udvalgte "
"europæiske pilotområder.\n"
"Hvert produkt er en Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF, der angiver "
"landoverfladetemperaturen i Kelvin.\n"
"Optagelser om dagen og om natten fra komplementære kredsløb gør "
"kollektionen velegnet til\n"
"studier af det daglige temperaturforløb, varmeøer i byer, tørke og "
"vandstress på overfladen."

