msgstr "Filen vil få vedhæftet logo."

msgid "A dataMask-band will be included in the downloaded raw bands as second band."
msgstr "Et dataMask-bånd medtages i de downloadede rå bånd som andet bånd."

msgid ""
"The Tagged Image File Format (TIFF) can hold a large number of bands, "
"however many common image viewers (e.g. Windows Photo Viewer) can't display "
"TIFF images with more than 3 bands.\n"
"If this option is enabled, only the first 3 bands will be included in the "
"image.\n"
"If this option is disabled, all bands will be included in the image, but "
"you will have to use an application which supports more than 3 bands (e.g. "
"QGIS) to display the TIFF image."
msgstr ""
"Tagged Image File Format (TIFF) kan indeholde et stort antal bånd, men "
"mange almindelige billedfremvisere (f.eks. Windows Photo Viewer) kan ikke "
"vise TIFF-billeder med mere end 3 bånd.\n"
"Hvis denne indstilling er aktiveret, medtages kun de første 3 bånd i "
"billedet.\n"
"Hvis denne indstilling er deaktiveret, medtages alle bånd i billedet, men "
"du skal bruge et program, der understøtter mere end 3 bånd (f.eks. QGIS), "
"for at vise TIFF-billedet."

